	[63]={ language="Linker"
},
	[64]={ language="1) This game is a 3D near-future sci-fi RPG mobile game suitable for players aged 16 and up, recommended for minors to use under parental supervision.\n2) This game is based on a fictional storyline and world view. Operator roles in the game are fictional and will not be confused with reality. The game Feature a combination of 2D and 3D sci-fi artwork, well-crafted with rich music. Players play as a squad Linker from [Leistance Security Bureau], rescuing disaster victims, handling crises from various forces, and fighting alien invaders alongside [AIMBS Operator]. The game has stranger interaction systems based on voice, text, and image, adhering to relevant laws and regulations.\n3) The game has a user real-name authentication system. Players authenticated as minors will receive the following management: \nSome gameplay and items require payment. Players aged 8 to 16 cannot recharge more than NT$250 per transaction, and no more than NT$1000 per month; \nPlayers aged 16 to 18 cannot recharge more than NT$500 per transaction, and no more than NT$2000 per month.\nFor minor users, only one hour of gameplay service will be provided from 8 PM to 9 PM on Fridays, Saturdays, Sundays, and national holidays. Minors will not be able to access the game at other times.\n4) Players need to develop a cultivation route and flexibly match role formations according to stage design and Operator, helping to improve thinking ability, hand-eye coordination, and quick reaction ability."
},
