	[3375]={ language="Focus Opposite—focus attacking units at the same position as itself. If no unit is at the same position, prioritize units on the same row. If neither condition is met, default to Focus Front Row for targeting.\n Focus Back Row—focus attacking units at the back row. If multiple units exist, prioritize units on the same row's back.\n Focus Front Row—focus attacking front row units. If multiple units exist, prioritize units on the same row's front."
},
	[3376]={ language="Duukey:"
},
	[3377]={ language="Focus Opposite—focus attacking units at the same position as itself. If no unit is at the same position, prioritize units on the same row. If neither condition is met, default to Focus Front Row for targeting.\n<color=#f05009>Focus Back Row</color>—focus attacking units at the back row. If multiple units exist, prioritize units on the same row's back.\n Focus Front Row—focus attacking front row units. If multiple units exist, prioritize units on the same row's front."
},
	[3378]={ language="Duukey:"
},
	[3379]={ language="<color=#f05009>Focus Opposite</color>—focus attacking units at the same position as itself. If no unit is at the same position, prioritize units on the same row. If neither condition is met, default to Focus Front Row for targeting.\n Focus Back Row—focus attacking units at the back row. If multiple units exist, prioritize units on the same row's back.\n Focus Front Row—focus attacking front row units. If multiple units exist, prioritize units on the same row's front."
},
	[3380]={ language="Duukey:"
},
	[3381]={ language="Focus Opposite—focus attacking units at the same position as itself. If no unit is at the same position, prioritize units on the same row. If neither condition is met, default to Focus Front Row for targeting.\n<color=#f05009>Focus Back Row</color>—focus attacking units at the back row. If multiple units exist, prioritize units on the same row's back.\n Focus Front Row—focus attacking front row units. If multiple units exist, prioritize units on the same row's front."
