	[3383]={ language="In battle, <color=#f05009>Support Operators</color> can greatly increase <color=#f05009>Striker Operators'</color> output limit, while exhibiting high Tenacity Break ability. Proper matching can unleash your team's full potential!"
},
	[3384]={ language="Duukey:"
},
	[3385]={ language="In battle, when <color=#f05009>Stun Operators</color> successfully control, they remove 40% of the target's tenacity. Flexibly using this feature during challenges can yield unexpected results!"
},
	[3386]={ language="Duukey:"
},
	[3387]={ language="In battle, <color=#f05009>Healer Operators</color> have healing recovery ability and are key figures in reducing dropout risk!"
},
	[3388]={ language="Duukey:"
},
	[3389]={ language="Human Feature—gain ability Enhance with each attack (Tenacity Break will clear buffs), and <color=#f05009>single damage</color> is most effective!\n Mechanical Feature—speed increases after each attack (Tenacity Break will clear buffs), and <color=#f05009>Tenacity Break</color> is most effective!\n Mutant Feature—restore 20% of lost HP at the start of each turn; <color=#f05009>Healing reduction from burning/color> is most effective!\n Shogger Feature—greatly increase attack upon ally death (Tenacity Break will clear buffs), and <color=#f05009>Group damage</color> is most effective."
},
	[3390]={ language="Duukey:"
},
	[3391]={ language="Human Feature—gain ability enhance with each attack (Tenacity Break will clear buffs), and single damage is most effective!\n Mechanical Feature—speed increases after each attack (Tenacity Break will clear buffs), and <color=#f05009>Tenacity Break</color> is most effective!\n Mutant Feature—restore 20% of lost HP at the start of each turn; Healing reduction from burning is most effective!\n Shogger Feature—greatly increase attack upon ally death (Tenacity Break will clear buffs), and group damage is most effective."
},
