	[26543]={ language="Human body, Pelim Alloy Armor, Crystal Model, Intelligence Brain, and Tactical Sigil"
},
	[26544]={ language="Tactical Intelligence Brain Center System, also known as Tactical Intelligence Brain, is developed by Leistance Deputy Director Chris Xalmi. It is a nanorobot that can influence cells and proteins in blood when implanted into the human brain, working in coordination with small molecules on a microscopic scale to achieve specific functions."
},
	[26545]={ language="Crystal Model Group is developed by Leistance Deputy Director Leone Xaviel. The Crystal Model technology primarily specializes in energy conversion, enhancing exoskeleton armor capabilities by using different Model encapsulations for energy transformation required by AIMBS."
},
	[26546]={ language="Pelim Alloy Memory Armor is the third generation of exoskeleton armor developed by the Lawton Institute of Bionic Mechanics. It uses Pelim memory alloy, but this armor requires a large amount of Energy to drive, mainly provided by Crystal technology and the Excalibur cold fusion power source."
},
	[26547]={ language="Tactical Command and Control Suppressor, in early AIMBS practical applications, was found that operators experienced a significant loss of control under the powerful Crystal Energy drive, so Leistance's technical department later developed a suppressor. Its main function is to neutralize the uncontrollable effects of Crystal Energy, harmonizing the Energy distribution of exoskeleton armor, but there is a function known only to the higher-ups, which is to suppress Energy, activated only when needed."
},
	[26548]={ language="With the development of AIMBS technology and the establishment of the Lode Federation, AIMBS technology gradually became public, leading nations to develop their AIMBS. AIMBS transitioned from being exclusive Campaign units of Leistance to Campaign units that all nations develop."
},
	[26549]={ language="While AIMBS's Campaign abilities are excellent, the intelligence brain also brings some side effects, such as an inability to effectively discern the stakes. There have been incidents where tasks were completed at the expense of harming civilians. On the moral level, more rational judgment by people is still needed."
},
	[26550]={ language="These AIMBS use high-impurity Crystals, providing low energy efficiency. These Crystals are relatively common on the market."
},
	[26551]={ language="These AIMBS use rare Primal Crystals, with high energy efficiency, but these crystals are extremely rare."
},
	[26552]={ language="Anima Crystal is an Energy entity refined from crystal ores. Visible Energy streaks flow on its surface. Initially discovered in mineral veins near anchors, it was later found that Crystal conversion technology could directly convert Anima Crystal into objects. Additionally, since Crystal minerals are also a high-concentration Energy entity, they later developed as an energy source."
},
	[26553]={ language="Standard crystal is a derivative after synthesizing Primal Crystal with local elements, mainly used as ordinary Shogger Energy recovery material, containing many impurities and low Energy purity."
},
	[26554]={ language="Currently, only a few Primal Crystal ores are known worldwide. It is known that they can be found during the Anchor Space, though extremely challenging to obtain."
},
	[26555]={ language="The basic structure of Anima Crystal is a Metatron cubic lattice, which is a mysterious crystal containing cosmic Energy. With the current Crystal Energy extraction technology mastered by humans, only fire, electricity, and ice elements can be extracted."
},
	[26556]={ language="A mysterious substance Q was discovered below the Ashley mineral vein. Q is an organic substance with high Energy. Kroward scientists successfully separated all Energy and organic matter from Q."
},
	[26557]={ language="Some believe that the mysterious substance Q evolved from ancient biological bodies."
},
	[26558]={ language="Scientists discovered that Q could perfectly merge with the native titanium element on earth, producing a new metal—Pelim Alloy. Pelim Alloy is the hardest metal currently known in the world, withstanding even 700,000°C without any signs of melting."
},
	[26559]={ language="Pelim Alloy also has the ability to absorb kinetic energy and reflect Energy."
},
	[26560]={ language="Pelim Alloy exhibits extremely strong bio-affinity, being resistant to secretions and corrosion within organisms, substantially stimulating phagocytes, enhancing immunity, and even slightly boosting various biological functions."
},
	[26561]={ language="Kroward discovered the FRB-265411 signal (Fast Radio Burst), which appears once every 28 days and lasted for a year. Kroward speculated that it might be information from an alien civilization, so they decided to respond to the FRB-265411 signal after discussion."
},
	[26562]={ language="At the Tashkomir Grand Canyon, Kroward began constructing the [Lorimer Signal Tower] to respond to the FRB-265411 signal. The [Lorimer Signal Tower] emitted a beam containing human DNA information and telecommunications signals about the stage of human civilization, and is waiting for a response."
},
	[26563]={ language="Due to the invasion of Shogger, fundamental scientific research on Earth has come to a halt."
},
	[26564]={ language="Lawton Institute of Bionic Mechanics (L.I.B.M) has developed the first-generation humanoid military combat robot (Resister combat robot), abbreviated as R.C.R. However, due to energy limitations and outdated command systems, the combat efficiency of R.C.R is not high and can only perform basic tasks."
},
	[26565]={ language="Rumor has it that the Joshburg government once secretly trained a Campaign unit—F.S.C.F, but little information is known to the outside world about this unit."
},
	[26566]={ language="The leading woman at Leistance Security Bureau is a Legendary AIMBS named Zeila. Zeila's unyielding spirit constantly provides a Morale Boost to all Leistance staff. Her personal plaque is currently housed in the Leistance Heroes Memorial."
},
	[26567]={ language="The Shogger virus is an RNA virus, capable of infection in nearly all living organisms in the world, even plants can be infected."
},
	[26568]={ language="Red gas emitted by Anchor Space, will infect all Earth organisms with the Infection Shogger virus."
},
	[26569]={ language="After infection, it shows irregular mutations, affecting the host like a tree disease, turning the skin into hard Air crystals, while the internal muscle tissue undergoes unimaginable Enhancement, becoming incredibly tough."
},
	[26570]={ language="Mutant's intelligence will greatly decrease. A few Mutants experience a lesser degree of decrease and still retain some awareness from before Infection, but their ability to think will inevitably greatly decrease."
},
	[26571]={ language="Ω parasites (also known as egg parasites) are organisms infected by Infection that gradually change their external appearance in stages. Ω parasites only infect mammalian organisms. Once inside the host, they gradually grow and eventually replace the host upon maturation. For Ω parasites, the host is merely a vessel."
},
	[26572]={ language="At any stage, the host's thinking ability will not decline."
},
	[26573]={ language="Some organisms, after being parasitized by egg worms, can absorb and merge the egg worms' genetic chains with their own powerful genes, mutating in a way that benefits themselves. During this process, they completely retain their original consciousness, and can even gain some mental assimilation abilities akin to those of the Shogger. These mutated individuals with original consciousness eventually become—Coordinators."
},
	[26574]={ language="Originally the Joshburg National Guard, after the Anchor Crisis, traditional units from two other countries were incorporated, and it was renamed the Resistance Army, mainly used to combat Shogger and Fission Entities, as well as various related cleanup and support tasks."
},
	[26575]={ language="After the Anchor Crisis erupted, Joshburg used his diplomatic skills to persuade Libercell and Ravenad to jointly establish the Lord Federation, sharing technology and resources to jointly resist the Shogger."
},
	[26576]={ language="The Lord Federation Independent Armed Forces, established after the Anchor Crisis, mainly consist of special forces from the three countries of the Lord Federation. They have higher combat capabilities compared to the resistance headquarters and often serve as support troops for the Leistance Campaign squads. The troops are equipped with a new generation of bionic mechanical weapons, with high Campaign capabilities and self-repair abilities."
},
	[26577]={ language="The independent organization established after the Anchor Crisis was jointly set up by Alice Laboratory, Lawton Institute of Bionic Mechanics, and 84laboratory. It's used for enhancing and centrally deploying all AIMBS Operators, with several combat squads under the Security Bureau."
},
	[26578]={ language="This project is a gene optimization initiative secretly launched by Shaun Biological Technology, aiming to enhance human intelligence and abilities, cure diseases, and extend human lifespan. However, halfway through, the project quietly came to a halt, and to this day, no one knows the exact reason why."
},
	[26579]={ language="Shogger doesn't have its own life form. Every form Shogger displays is a shape of a race it has assimilated."
},
	[26580]={ language="When Shogger assimilates other organisms, it retains most of the target's Feature but changes the genetic structure inside them, generating El Crystals. These crystals then burst out and protrude, forming a rock-like physiological structure."
},
	[26581]={ language="Assimilation gene chain can also cause some unpredictable mutations in the organism itself, like a single-headed wolf turning into a three-headed wolf."
},
	[26582]={ language="Shogger is internally divided into ranks: Dominator, Apostle, Sentinel, Artisan, Combat Engineer"
},
	[26583]={ language="In order to control the behavior of all Shogger, the ruler created a unique Shogger that only follows its commands. These Shogger are responsible for delivering the ruler's orders to every corner of the tribe. The Shogger that belong only to the ruler are called apostles, and each apostle has a special task."
},
	[26584]={ language="Special Shoggers under the Apostle's command are used for reconnaissance and exploration. These Shoggers don't have strong combat abilities, but they excel in construction, warp, and information analysis. Each Apostle has their own exclusive sentinels, and these sentinels are only responsible to the Apostle. The information they gather is shared only with the Apostle."
},
