	[28032]={ language="Detailed Rules"
},
	[28033]={ language="* Base rate for linking SSR Operator is <color=#f05009>2%</color>. If you don't get SSR Operator for <color=#f05009>49</color> consecutive times, you are guaranteed to get SSR Operator the next time. (Drop count will carry over to the next UP Operator pool)\nWhen you get an SSR Operator, there's a <color=#f05009>20%</color> chance it's the current UP Operator. If the obtained SSR Operator is not the UP Operator, the chance of getting the UP Operator next time will increase from <color=#f05009>20%</color> to <color=#f05009>60%</color>, and so on, until you get the current UP Operator with <color=#f05009>100%</color> chance.<color=#f05009>After the current banner ends, the limited Operator will not be available in the Regular Link or UP Link.</color>"
},
