	[28037]={ language="* Base rate for dropping SSR Sigil is <color=#f05009>2.5%</color>. If you don't get SSR Sigil for <color=#f05009>39</color> consecutive times, you are guaranteed to get SSR Sigil the next time. (Drop count will carry over to the next UP Sigil pool)\nWhen you get an SSR Sigil, there's a <color=#f05009>25%</color> chance it's the current UP Sigil. If the obtained SSR Sigil is not the UP Sigil, the chance of getting the UP Sigil next time will increase from <color=#f05009>25%</color> to <color=#f05009>62.5%</color>, and so on, until you get the current UP Sigil with <color=#f05009>100%</color> chance.<color=#f05009>After the current banner ends, the limited Sigil will not be available in the Regular Sigil or UP Sigil.</color>"
