	[41017]={ language="Thank you for your attention and support for [Anchor Panic]. The [Anchor Test] officially starts on April 22nd at 10:00. \n\n Linker, are you ready for battle?\n\n[Open Server Notice]\n1. Test time: April 22, 2021, 10:00—April 26, 15:00\n2. This test version is an early development version focusing mainly on gameplay. There may be several issues, so we ask for your understanding and support as we progress. Please feel free to provide any feedback or suggestions through the [Feedback & Suggestions Thread].\n3. Due to the game's limited development progress, this is a limited closed test with no charges. If you did not receive a test qualification, please stay tuned for further updates.\n4. [Prohibited Actions] This test is currently only available on the Android platform, the iOS platform is not yet open. Please pay attention to subsequent news.\n\n[Prohibited Items]\n1. Account sharing/account trading is prohibited. Once discovered, your test qualifications will be canceled and further actions will be taken. Please protect your account information, as any losses from negligence will be your responsibility.\n2. Using technology to analyze, modify, attack, or engage in any unfair actions within the game is prohibited.\n3. The use of cheats, third-party tools, and any improper means of undermining game fairness is prohibited."
},
