	[53301]={ language="At the moment an enemy attack is about to hit you, tap the <color=#3959d2>Energy Field</color> button at the bottom right corner of the screen to parry it. If timed right, you can completely negate the damage.\nIn each round, our side has a total of <color=#FF0000>100</color> points of <color=#3959d2>Field Energy</color>. Successfully using the <color=#3959d2>Energy Field</color> to parry enemy attacks consumes <color=#FF0000>25</color> points of <color=#3959d2>Field Energy</color>, while failure does not consume any <color=#3959d2>Field Energy</color>.\n\nThe practice opponent is quite strong, please time your use of <color=#3959d2>Energy Field</color>wisely to defeat the opponent!"
},
