	[524018]={ language="Lightning Mind Egg Ω"
},
	[600001]={ language="Currency issued by Lod Coalition, tested by time.\n\n<color=#404548>With Lod Coalition becoming one of the global language powerholders, the currency issued by the Union Central Bank gradually became the most recognized international currency by nations, and was renamed as [Taino Currency].</color>"
},
	[600003]={ language="Synthetic material containing the glow of Stellar Crystal, used for rare commodity procurement.\n\n<color=#404548>After various countries announced Stellar Crystal as a nationalized resource, Crystal Ashes mixed with various impurities gradually became a currency for rare material exchanges or secret commercial activities. Although it can't compare to Stellar Crystal, its faint glow is still alluring to people.</color>"
},
	[600004]={ language="One of the internal exchange Licenses issued by Leistance, used to purchase rare materials.\n\n<color=#404548> Vouchers obtained after winning Arena matches. As the saying goes, literature ranks no.1, martial arts no.2; the naked competition is between peers. Yet there's always a civilized solution.</color>"
},
	[600005]={ language="One of the internal exchange Licenses issued by Leistance, used to furnish Dorms.\n\n<color=#404548> Decorating your room well is also an important part of battle, as home is the true haven.</color>"
},
	[600006]={ language="Private currency obtained from competitive ladders, used to purchase various rare items at the Battle Honors Trading Post."
},
	[600007]={ language="Basic currency obtained from Sub-Story, used to purchase various rare items at the Sub-Story Store."
},
	[600008]={ language="One of the internal exchange Licenses issued by Leistance, used to purchase materials required for scientific research Models.\n\n<color=#404548>Technological innovation is a crucial pillar for Leistance's steady progress. To maintain world-class scientific standards, the leadership of the Security Bureau give many special approvals to meet the needs of researchers.</color>"
},
	[600009]={ language="The degree of Trust an Operator has towards Linker, can be increased by gifting."
},
	[600010]={ language="The means to safely delve into Void Particles Contaminated Zone and Anchor Space.\n\n<color=#404548>Please ensure you have enough Erosion RES before entering polluted areas; no one wishes to turn into a monster, remember.</color>"
},
	[600011]={ language="Detailed report of Operator battles, used to level up Operators.\n\n<color=#404548>A chip recording experiences from many outstanding Operator battles. Browsing reveals the reading count exceeds five figures.\n Only with a clear mind can learning capabilities be enhanced; carelessly absorbing information is not a good habit.</color>"
},
	[600012]={ language="The experience needed to upgrade Linker."
},
	[600013]={ language="Contribution points obtained after completing various scientific activities, can be used for upgrading the central hub.\n\n<color=#404548>——Make Leistance great again!</color>"
},
	[600014]={ language="Starship Model information produced by the processing factory, can be used for starship development."
},
	[600015]={ language="Highly valuable and rare advanced resource, known to everyone on Taino Star.\n\n<color=#404548>A fascinating substance existing in various forms, containing brilliance beyond stars.\n It is the source of [vitality] for humanity's new era, now widely used in various sophisticated fields of research, its mining and distribution strictly controlled by governments worldwide.</color>"
},
	[600019]={ language="Industrial dedicated robots developed by Leistance's War Supplies Division, significantly boosting workshop and factory efficiency.\n\n<color=#404548>——Mechanization is the milestone for freeing labor; perhaps one day, tireless machines will completely replace human workers.</color>"
},
	[600020]={ language="Irregular crystal blocks collected from Sub-Story, used to exchange supplies in the Sub-Story item category."
},
	[600021]={ language="Unique currency within Sub-Story, can only be used as circulating currency in this no man's land, other foreign currencies are inconvenient.\n\n<color=#404548>>——[Sub-Story has its rules, no matter who you are, you must follow them in this place. That's advice, my friend.]</color>"
},
	[600024]={ language="Chips printed by the printing device, recording detailed information after each Desert Adventure.\n\n<color=#404548>Recording pain, despair, will, and tenacity...then turning them into stronger power, this is our path forward.</color>"
},
	[600025]={ language="Token obtained from completing daily missions in Missions.\n\n<color=#404548>Gained by completing daily missions</color>"
},
	[600026]={ language="Points needed to level up the Battle Pass, obtained from completing daily and weekly missions in Missions.\n\n<color=#404548>Completing contract missions isn't difficult, but persistence is key.</color>"
},
	[600027]={ language="Repeatedly acquired outfits will be converted to this license.\n\n<color=#404548>Can be used at the outfit store to buy new outfits</color>"
},
	[600029]={ language="License obtained in Advanced Arena, used for product exchange at Arena Supplies II."
},
	[600030]={ language="Substance and mineral combination produced after Shogger's death, can be exchanged for supplies at Union Store.\nCommonly found in large virtual corrosion domains as mutated crystals, possessing a certain level of recycling value due to its high concentration of Void Particles."
},
	[600031]={ language="Unique currency within City Unlimited, using Shogger's skull as its emblem, can only be used as circulating currency in this no man's land.\n\n——[City Unlimited has its rules, no matter who you are, you must follow them in this place. That's advice, my friend.]"
},
	[600035]={ language="A unique substance captured from Eden's data observations. Can be exchanged for items in the Land Clash store.\nAfter ■■■ cycles of computation and restructuring, data accumulation has generated certain redundancies. Its structure shows similarities to the crystals formed upon Shogger's death, granting it significant research and recovery value."
},
	[600900]={ language="Special shopping license issued by Leistance Logistics Department in limited quantities and universally accepted by Taino Star, offering a 75% discount when selecting clothing for Operators.\nThis special card is only valid during non-discounted periods for themed outfits and must be used within 7 days after acquisition."
},
	[600901]={ language="Contains Regular Link Permit x10"
},
