	[601500]={ language="Information chip overflowing after an Operator reaches full stars, can be used to exchange for other Operator Info based on the principle of resource utilization. The cost-effectiveness depends entirely on market conditions.\n\n<color=#404548>[Exchange 3 A chips for C's photo collection—]</color>"
},
