	[601534]={ language="ヒトミ情報副本、その者のさまざまな情報が記録されている。"
},
	[601535]={ language="白薔薇情報副本、その者のさまざまな情報が記録されている。"
},
	[601536]={ language="弦花情報副本、その者のさまざまな情報が記録されている。"
},
	[601537]={ language="鳴曄情報副本、その者のさまざまな情報が記録されている。"
},
	[602000]={ language="A general Tutorial ticket issued by Leistance to better improve the AIMBS.\n\n—Regardless of nationality, age, or identity, each AIMBS can use it equally to enhance their rating in the Battle system."
},
	[602001]={ language="Basic material for Model construction, can be exchanged for other Models at the trade place.\n\n<color=#404548>Can be obtained by disassembling extra Models.</color>"
},
	[602011]={ language="Use to gain 200 EXP.\n\nAn integrated experience report gained after reviewing battle records with ordinary monsters, helping AIMBS better understand combat.\n\nUnderstanding the battle thoroughly before engaging can help in coping with crises."
},
	[602012]={ language="Use to gain 600 EXP.\n\nAn integrated experience report gained after reviewing battle records with advanced monsters, helping AIMBS better understand combat.\n\nUnderstanding the battle thoroughly before engaging can help in coping with crises."
},
	[602013]={ language="Use to gain 1,800 EXP.\n\nAn integrated experience report gained after reviewing battle records with elite monsters, helping AIMBS better understand combat.\n\nUnderstanding the battle thoroughly before engaging can help in coping with crises."
},
	[602021]={ language="One of the ways provided by Leistance Security Bureau procurement department for each Linker to quickly expand the squad size, can randomly obtain an AIMBS Operator when opened."
},
	[602022]={ language="A link permit issued by the Leistance Battle Center that allows you to go to the link terminal for Information retrieval.\n\n<color=#404548> The Star Council possesses the most extensive database of humans adapted to Stellar Crystal, through which, as a direct subordinate, Leistance can quickly retrieve the needed personnel Information.</color>"
},
	[602023]={ language="A special link permit issued by the Leistance Battle Center that allows for a limited Link Search at the link terminal.\n\n<color=#404548> The Star Council possesses the most extensive database of humans adapted to Stellar Crystal, through which, as a direct subordinate, Leistance can quickly retrieve the needed personnel Information.</color>"
},
	[602051]={ language="A mass-produced D-Blood Reagent developed by the Leistance Battle Center, can be used for Sigil shaping.\n\n<color=#404548>Ancient knowledge passed down and calculated over the centuries preserves the reverence for gods, even though the Star Council has given it a new name, people still commonly refer to it as [D-Blood].</color>"
},
	[602052]={ language="A specially-made D-Blood Reagent developed by the Leistance Battle Center, exceeding the mass-produced specification, can be used for Sigil forming.\n\n<color=#404548>Ancient knowledge passed down and calculated over the centuries preserves the reverence for gods, even though the Star Council has given it a new name, people still commonly refer to it as [D-Blood].</color>"
},
	[602060]={ language="Residues appearing during the Sigil shaping process using D-Blood Reagent, possess high recycling value, can be exchanged for rare materials at the research institute.\n\n<color=#404548>Even in the highest-level research, the composition of this crystal product can't be fully analyzed, yet researchers still flock to solve its mysteries.</color>"
},
	[602061]={ language="Nuclide products used for Sigil Empower, jointly developed by Leistance Engineering and Technology Departments, incorporate multiple cutting-edge technologies, yet other countries still fail to replicate it.\n—[Doing this feels like a competition, is that really okay?] [We have no choice, history will judge the merit of this technology.]"
},
	[602071]={ language="Moonlight Kiss carnival ticket, a token of celestial fortune.\n\n Used to participate in the Carnival Wishes event."
},
	[602072]={ language="A rare natural crystal infused with the radiance of Stellar Crystal, circulating only among elites, exchangeable for equally precious goods.\n\nCan be traded at the Carnival Wishes event store (will be removed after event)"
},
	[602073]={ language="Get close and listen carefully, and you might just hear the heartbeats of little foxes.\n\nUsed to participate in prize draws during the Fox Blessings event. (Will be recycled after event)"
},
	[602074]={ language="A rare natural crystal infused with the radiance of Stellar Crystal, circulating only among elites, exchangeable for equally precious goods.\n\nCan be traded at the Fox Blessings event store (Will be recycled after event)"
},
	[602150]={ language="Arena License, made by the Leistance Battle Center, with advanced anti-counterfeiting technology.\n\n<color=#404548>Although the Security Bureau isn't fond of intense internal competition, people find fun in it. To properly guide them, the tactical center specially made chip-style tickets to satisfy their desire.</color>"
},
	[602151]={ language="One of the internal exchange certificates issued by Leistance, used to purchase rare materials.\n\nThe certificate obtained after winning at the Arena. As the situation evolves, the Security Bureau's Campaign demand for AIMBS and Linkers at various level grows, making the Arena environment more challenging—thus starting comprehensive Arena, offering a bigger stage for the competitive folks."
},
	[602169]={ language="Polylattice material emerging with the entropy-enthalpy changes of Void Particles, currently unable to stably recreate its birth process, researchers are striving for this.\nNo one can resist such a splendid gemstone, but it should hold greater value than mere ornamentation—even at this stage, we can't analyze its composition and structure."
},
	[602161]={ language="A plugin specifically supplied by the Leistance Engineering Department to adapt to increasingly urgent Battle situations.\n\nHaving greater adaptability allows for upgrades to all Models via Remodel."
},
	[602170]={ language="Rewards obtained for participating in Union-related projects, used to purchase Union Supply and initiate related Union activities.\nRare currency validated and supported by the Star Council, aimed at encouraging the heroic behavior of the Unions composed of various AIMBS squads in the Void Expanse."
},
	[602171]={ language="Enhancement material for [Physical Technology] under Union Technology."
},
	[602172]={ language="Enhancement material for [Lightning Technology] under Union Technology."
},
	[602173]={ language="Enhancement material for [Fire Technology] under Union Technology."
},
	[602174]={ language="Enhancement material for [Ice Technology] under Union Technology."
},
	[602175]={ language="Enhancement material for [Natural Technology] under Union Technology."
},
	[602176]={ language="Enhancement material for [Quantum Technology] under Union Technology."
},
	[602201]={ language="Use to gain 30 Erosion RES.\n\n<color=#404548>Small dose medicine for survival in Void Particles contaminated zone, containing special chemicals that rapidly neutralize its own contamination area. Including a small amount of active ingredients to meet the user's emergency needs.</color>"
},
	[602202]={ language="Use to gain 60 Erosion RES.\n\n<color=#404548>Standard dose medicine for survival in Void Particles contaminated zone, containing special chemicals that rapidly neutralize its own contamination area. \nThough many professionals consider it merely another form of Stimulant, it's just out of spite due to unavailability of the recipe, but sales speak the truth.</color>"
},
	[602203]={ language="Use to gain 120 Erosion RES.\n\n<color=#404548>Large dose concentrated medicine for sustained survival in Void Particles contaminated zone, containing special chemicals to rapidly neutralize its own contamination. Incorporates new drug manufacturing technology, containing various new drugs powerful enough to rejuvenate users.\n[This product adopts the latest anti-counterfeiting methods, any discovered counterfeit will face the strictest legal actions from our company.]—From the bottom of the package's official statement.</color>"
},
	[602204]={ language="Use to gain 180 Erosion RES.\n\n<color=#404548>Large dose concentrated medicine for sustained survival in Void Particles contaminated zone, containing special chemicals to rapidly neutralize its own contamination. Incorporates new drug manufacturing technology, containing various new drugs powerful enough to rejuvenate users.\n[This product adopts the latest anti-counterfeiting methods, any discovered counterfeit will face the strictest legal actions from our company.]—From the bottom of the package's official statement.</color>"
},
	[602301]={ language="Can catch king salmon, northern pike, field fish, sweetfish, dace, tilapia, bluegill, betta, waterweeds.\n\nFly imitation bait that attracts fish, loved by anglers. (Can be exchanged in the event Store)"
},
	[602302]={ language="Can catch field fish, sleeper goby fish, stream fish, tilapia, crab, old can, waterweeds.\n\nBait made of tender corn, attracts fish, loved by anglers. (Can be exchanged in the event Store)"
},
	[602303]={ language="Can catch yellow bass, dace, bluegill, betta, anchor.\n\nBait mixed with fruit puree and grains, attracts fish, loved by anglers. (Can be exchanged in the event Store)"
},
	[602304]={ language="Can catch king salmon, northern pike, black bass, red-eye crucian carp, snapping turtle, anchor.\n\nBait with mysterious spices, attracts fish, loved by anglers. (Can be exchanged in the event Store)"
},
	[602305]={ language="Can catch loach, sleeper goby fish, black bass, yellow bass, stream fish, piranha, crucian carp, red-eye crucian carp, crab, softshell turtle, snapping turtle, old can.\n\nNatural bait from nature, attracts fish, loved by anglers. (Can be exchanged in the event Store)"
},
	[602306]={ language="Can catch loach, sweetfish, piranha, crucian carp, softshell turtle, old can, waterweeds.\n\nNatural bait from nature, attracts fish, loved by anglers. (Can be exchanged in the event Store)"
},
	[602351]={ language="A gold-plated trophy certified and awarded by the Joshburg Fishing Association, only a very few fishing masters receive this honor.\n—Heavy rains won't dampen our passion, terrain won't limit our performance!\n—Our motto: never an empty hook!"
},
	[602401]={ language="Made from the mutated crystals collected by Leistance. Can be used for the ultimate enhancement of Operator skills.\n\n<color=#404548>The perfect and stable structure of Void Particles sets it apart from other discrete Anima, making it the only precious material for strengthening control over Void Particles. Finding it requires not just strength, but also considerable luck and certain special means.</color>"
},
	[602451]={ language="A basic drive chip developed by Leistance. Can be used for the enhancement of Operator skills.\n\n<color=#404548>Contains a wealth of materials and user insights, can increase Operators' proficiency in skills.</color>"
},
	[602452]={ language="A medium drive chip developed by Leistance. Can be used for the enhancement of Operator skills.\n\n<color=#404548>Contains partial original materials and user insights, can further increase Operators' proficiency in skills.</color>"
},
	[602453]={ language="An advanced drive chip developed by Leistance. Can be used for the enhancement of Operator skills.\n\n<color=#404548>Contains a wealth of original materials and user insights, can increase Operators' mastery of skills when used with a drive core.</color>"
},
	[602502]={ language="A badge symbolizing ability certification. Can be used for the potential breakthrough of Physical Type Operators.\n\n<color=#404548> A standard certification badge issued by the Leistance Battle Center, recognizing the Operators' calm in emergencies.</color>"
},
	[602460]={ language="A rare special material whose starlight even surpasses that of its Stellar Crystals, can completely enhance the Resonance between Operators and their Stellaron.\n—Due to its overly radical research theories, it was once banned by the Star Council, until the Anchor Space capable of destroying cities came, the so-called forbidden technology was turned into a human weapon."
},
	[602461]={ language="A container containing special materials emitting a Physical type Stellaron mark. Can be used to enhance an Operators' Stellaron Resonance.\n\nIt is said to have once been the world origin worshiped and deeply believed by people of a bygone era, now scientifically explained as a means of material application."
},
	[602462]={ language="A container containing special materials emitting a Lightning type Stellaron mark. Can be used to enhance Operators' Stellaron Resonance.\n\nIt is said to have once been the world origin worshiped and deeply believed by people of a bygone era, now scientifically explained as a means of material application."
},
	[602463]={ language="A container containing special materials emitting a Fire type Stellaron mark. Can be used to enhance Operators' Stellaron Resonance.\n\nIt is said to have once been the world origin worshiped and deeply believed by people of a bygone era, now scientifically explained as a means of material application."
},
	[602464]={ language="A container containing special materials emitting an Ice type Stellaron mark. Can be used to enhance Operators' Stellaron Resonance.\n\nIt is said to have once been the world origin worshiped and deeply believed by people of a bygone era, now scientifically explained as a means of material application."
},
	[602465]={ language="A container containing special materials emitting a Natural type Stellaron mark. Can be used to enhance Operators' Stellaron Resonance.\n\nIt is said to have once been the world origin worshiped and deeply believed by people of a bygone era, now scientifically explained as a means of material application."
},
