	[608001]={ language="Provide 400 points Model Enhance experience.\n\n<color=#404548>Commonly known as junk or waste, although worn out, it still contains some recyclable electronic components.</color>"
},
	[608002]={ language="Provides 800 Model Enhance EXP.\n\n<color=#404548>Mechanical parts that are 70% new, retaining the complete internal structure. Besides direct reuse, engineers from the war supplies department occasionally use these parts to create other things.</color>"
},
	[608003]={ language="Provides 1,600 Model Enhance EXP.\n\n<color=#404548>Brand new mechanical parts, every groove and every notch showcase exceptional craftsmanship.\nTreat them well, making the most out of them is a tribute to the maker.</color>"
},
