},
	[608102]={ language="Provides 2,400 Sigil Enhance EXP.\n\n<color=#404548>High-quality Sigil Enhancer. Can be used to enhance Sigils.</color>"
},
	[608103]={ language="Provides 4,800 Sigil Enhance EXP.\n\n<color=#404548>Top-quality Sigil Enhancer. Can be used to enhance Sigils.</color>"
},
	[609012]={ language="Regular purification stabilizer. Used for low-level Sigil purification.\n\n<color=#404548>D-Blood purification stabilizer developed by Leistance. Can further increase Sigil's ability caps.</color>"
},
	[609013]={ language="Advanced purification stabilizer. Used for mid-stage Sigil purification.\n\n<color=#404548>D-Blood purification stabilizer developed by Leistance. Can further increase Sigil's ability caps.</color>"
},
	[609014]={ language="Special purification stabilizer. Used for high-level Sigil purification.\n\n<color=#404548>D-Blood purification stabilizer developed by Leistance. Can further increase Sigil's ability caps.</color>"
},
	[611001]={ language="Gifting an Operator can increase 1,000 Trust points.\n\n<color=#404548>Yearly Limited Edition mechanical watch by a renowned watchmaker. Handcrafted by master artisans.\n[Its hands carry the flow of time.]</color>"
},
	[611002]={ language="Gifting an Operator can increase 200 Trust points.\n\n<color=#404548>A glance at the adorable kitten puppet can heal the heart, and holding it brings warmth to the soul. It has a very pleasant touch.</color>"
},
	[611003]={ language="Gifting an Operator can increase 1,000 Trust points.\n\n<color=#404548>Can record AIMBS's physical condition and provide timely feedback to healer center terminal. (Reportedly similar to the one customized by Korinna's brother for her)</color>"
},
	[611004]={ language="Gifting an Operator can increase 600 Trust points.\n\n<color=#404548>There are still quite a few people who believe this crystal substance can predict upcoming events. With their boasting, crystal balls made from this type of crystal have gradually gained collectible value.</color>"
},
	[611005]={ language="Gifting an Operator can increase 1,000 Trust points.\n\n<color=#404548>Leistance Security Bureau exclusive honor medal, with special commemorative significance, issued by Linker.</color>"
},
	[611006]={ language="Gifting an Operator can increase 1,000 Trust points.\n\n<color=#404548>[Oh, you're talking about Bartianta? She ordered rice-stuffed dumplings again this Friday. I can make them, but I still don't get why she likes this dish. Is it a specialty from her hometown?]\n—The cafeteria uncle's question when planning the weekly menu.</color>"
},
	[611007]={ language="Gifting an Operator can increase 1,000 Trust points.\n\n<color=#404548>Plants always amaze people, but once turned into specimens, they escape their original fate of life and death, not fading over time.</color>"
},
	[611008]={ language="Gifting an Operator can increase 1,000 Trust points.\n\n<color=#404548> Merlot's self-made playing cards, the designs are hand-drawn by her with a tiny marked sentence on the card face: Stay away from gambling. Fun comes first.</color>"
},
	[611009]={ language="Gifting an Operator can increase 200 Trust points.\n\n<color=#404548>It used to be the most valuable and hardest natural mineral in the market, but as people's understanding has grown, nowadays only a few people still collect it.</color>"
},
	[611010]={ language="Gifting an Operator can increase 200 Trust points.\n\n<color=#404548>A very old film storage medium, nobody knows what's inside, since machines that play these kinds of discs are extremely rare now. Its value as a collectible far exceeds its practical use.</color>"
},
	[611011]={ language="Gifting an Operator can increase 600 Trust points.\n\n<color=#404548>Old model camera, more valuable as a collectible than for its use.\n[The significance of recording now lies in capturing from humanity's constant setbacks to the day when we rise up, waving the banner of light. This process needs to be documented, or humanity will surely regret it immensely.]\n—Excerpt from [Joshburg Resistance Daily]</color>"
},
	[611012]={ language="Gifting an Operator can increase 600 Trust points.\n\n<color=#404548>Designed an educational toy with chess pieces and a board based on the current world situation. Although it's not as widespread as regular chessboards, it has gained some popularity among people who enjoy analyzing global situations.</color>"
},
	[611101]={ language="Gifting an Operator can increase 600 Trust points.\n\n<color=#404548>The appearance uses top-notch fuzzy materials. Both its feel and texture are excellent and it's very popular.</color>"
},
	[611102]={ language="Gifting an Operator can increase 1,000 Trust points.\n\n<color=#404548>The bundled books contain three volumes, covering various fields, and they hold collectible value and reading significance.</color>"
},
	[611103]={ language="Gifting an Operator can increase 1,000 Trust points.\n\n<color=#404548>The limited edition mech models launched by Divinelight Heavy Tech Toy Company, with 5,000 units worldwide, hold irreplaceable commemorative value.</color>"
},
	[611104]={ language="Gifting an Operator can increase 600 Trust points.\n\n<color=#404548>Once a popular toy that was all the rage, but most have been discontinued now. It's a nostalgic item for many, with irreplaceable sentimental value.</color>"
},
	[611105]={ language="Gifting an Operator can increase 600 Trust points.\n\n<color=#404548>Weird food made by Antilope always includes bold and innovative ingredients and seasonings. It looks terrifying but oddly always ends up tasting good.</color>"
},
	[611106]={ language="Gifting an Operator can increase 600 Trust points.\n\n<color=#404548>Includes over 3,000 insect species, making it the most complete insect species ecological guide of the Lod Coalition, although most species have gone extinct.</color>"
},
	[611107]={ language="Gifting an Operator can increase 1,000 Trust points.\n\n<color=#404548>The latest model of civilian electronic products, with top-notch configuration.\n[Feature a front camera with x billion pixels... top processor... xxx Hz frame rate...]\n[X99999, want to be friends?]</color>"
},
	[611108]={ language="Gifting an Operator can increase 200 Trust points.\n\n<color=#404548>Crispy wafers paired with delicious chocolate and smooth milk jam, bringing you a rich taste experience.</color>"
},
	[611109]={ language="Gifting an Operator can increase 1,000 Trust points.\n\n<color=#404548>Lifetime gym membership card, valid chain-wide, available for five single-use Tutorial rooms a month.</color>"
},
	[611110]={ language="Gifting an Operator can increase 200 Trust points.\n\n<color=#404548>Classic mixed milk-flavored lollipop with 10 different flavors, share more flavors together and enjoy sweet moments.</color>"
},
	[611111]={ language="Gifting an Operator can increase 600 Trust points.\n\n<color=#404548>Cosmetics crafted with the most advanced maintenance technology, aiming to provide the best and most comfortable skin experience.</color>"
},
	[611112]={ language="Gifting an Operator can increase 200 Trust points.\n\n<color=#404548>From mineral powder, plant extracts, to animal extracts, all types of high-purity pigments are available, with over 60 colors to meet various painting needs.</color>"
},
	[611201]={ language="Gifting an Operator can increase 200 Trust points.\n\n<color=#404548>Carbonated drink in a red bottle package is popular with most people, but many also like another color package.</color>"
},
	[611202]={ language="Gifting an Operator can increase 200 Trust points.\n\n<color=#404548>A fried fast food gift box with a white-bearded older man's image, containing fried chicken, fries, burgers, crispy roasted chicken, and a cup of dark brown soda. Eating it can brighten your mood.\n(This set is sold only on Fridays)</color>"
},
	[611203]={ language="Gifting an Operator can increase 600 Trust points.\n\n<color=#404548>A certain brand has launched the latest generation console, equipped with a new processor, aiming to provide players with the highest quality gaming experience.\n[xxx is the ruler of the world!]—A loyal fan of the brand.</color>"
},
	[611204]={ language="Gifting an Operator can increase 600 Trust points.\n\n<color=#404548>A landscape painting by a master, possessing very high artistic value.</color>"
},
	[611205]={ language="Gifting an Operator can increase 1,000 Trust points.\n\n<color=#404548>The cover has a specific logo and is packed with plastic wrap, limited edition, high potential for appreciation.</color>"
},
	[611206]={ language="Gifting an Operator can increase 200 Trust points.\n\n<color=#404548> Lod Coalition's biggest chain supermarket discount card, which also allows you to enjoy points and exchange gifts, is well-liked by everyone.</color>"
},
	[611207]={ language="Gifting an Operator can increase 1,000 Trust points.\n\n<color=#404548>Wine made from starchy or sugary substances like grain or fruit through fermentation, stored in a cellar for years, is perfect for a couple of sips during dinner with someone important.</color>"
},
	[611208]={ language="Gifting an Operator can increase 1,000 Trust points.\n\n<color=#404548>These stones are formed from the remains or relics of various creatures from the distant past. They have a very, very high collectible value, but not everyone can appreciate them.</color>"
},
	[611209]={ language="Gifting an Operator can increase 600 Trust points.\n\n<color=#404548>Weapon blueprint not yet implemented, looks very challenging.</color>"
},
	[611210]={ language="Gifting an Operator can increase 200 Trust points.\n\n<color=#404548>A puzzle made with top-notch scanning and printing technology, mostly featuring AIMBS from Leistance Security Bureau promotions. Many people use them as decorations.\n(It's said that Dawn really dislikes her image being on them.)</color>"
},
	[611211]={ language="Gifting an Operator can increase 600 Trust points.\n\n<color=#404548>[Big Pen] full set of electronic cleaning equipment, bringing you an easy and enjoyable house cleaning experience.</color>"
},
	[611212]={ language="Gifting an Operator can increase 1,000 Trust points.\n\n<color=#404548>A banquet dress handcrafted by master craftsmen, every stitch is meticulously crafted.</color>"
},
	[611213]={ language="Gifting an Operator can increase 1,000 Trust points.\n\n<color=#404548>A specially crafted powerful fishing gear blended with modern science and technology, equipped with positioning detection and automatic bait-changing Feature, making it easier for anglers to use.</color>"
},
	[611214]={ language="Gifting an Operator can increase 600 Trust points.\n\n<color=#404548>A kind of souvenir that every aquarium and coastal city sells, symbolized by dolphins. Although it's not clear why, they are not cheap.</color>"
},
	[611215]={ language="Giving Operator can boost 200 Trust value.\n\n<color=#404548>A crispy, aromatic, and diverse snack that brings joy with no side effects.</color>"
},
	[611216]={ language="Gifting Operator can increase Trust by 200.\n\n<color=#404548>Can receive a free massage service from Linker, 10 minutes each time</color>"
},
	[611501]={ language="Open to randomly obtain 1 ordinary gift, with a low chance to receive 1 exquisite gift.\n\n<color=#404548>A common gift box containing a small gift.</color>"
},
	[611502]={ language="Open to randomly obtain 1 exquisite gift, with a low chance to receive 1 rare gift.\n\n<color=#404548>According to veteran members within the bureau, initially, this was merely a method by the security bureau to dispose of excess unused materials. However, over time, people gradually started seeing it as a form of social etiquette...</color>"
},
	[611503]={ language="Open to randomly obtain 1 rare gift.\n\n<color=#404548>[It's possible to get nothing from such a precious thing... How do I know this? Have you heard of the seven legends of Leistance? If not, now you do.]—an Operator said angrily upon realizing her was the protagonist of this legend.</color>"
