	[612362]={ language="A theatrical game, Newcastle is quite pleased with this intriguing event and gladly stepped into her role. Her body relaxed, and her long hair and witch's robe fluttered under the influence of Stellaron Resonance.\n[Ah... What are you hoping to get from me? Before we discuss terms, let's enjoy this rare night together... Don't fear the thorns, dear, I believe this slight pain will excite you even more.]"
},
	[612363]={ language="Strictly according to the script, this scene should follow the battle, but now, the witch who should have been vanquished has bound herself and is quietly awaiting your arrival.\n[Fearless adventurers will eventually earn their rightful reward. Perhaps tonight, I will have the honor to be your well-earned prize for this arduous journey.]\n[Dear adventurer, there's no need to show mercy to a witch. Whatever treatment I receive from you, I'll savor it gladly.]"
},
	[612364]={ language="As a genius, Deling can easily adapt to anything, even though she vaguely senses a subtle difference between her role and others, she is doing her job earnestly, playing her part as required... although she added a touch of personal desire.\n[Hello, dear adventurer, would you like to stay here and play with me? Surely you wouldn't be able to refuse such a cute little witch, would you?]"
},
	[612365]={ language="A witch newly awakened from slumber seeks assistance from the adventurer due to her lack of power... Clearly, Marceline struggles with this role-playing game, but her love and admiration for you help her overcome this.\n[Honored Linker... I mean, adventurer, I am willing to be your follower and heed your guidance... Please... please replenish my magic... Ugh... what should I do next... Linker...]"
},
	[612366]={ language="You discover a captured and pitiful prey in your office... Tsk tsk, you lean on the leather chairback, leisurely watching the girl desperately tiptoe to maintain balance and prevent herself from being too embarrassed.\nClearly, she notices your mocking gaze and glances at you with some defiance.\n[Don't stare at me... being tied up like this is so embarrassing... How could Bravery's Poharo end up in such a position... and you saw it!... Is this supposed to be fun? Really?]"
},
	[612367]={ language="You walk into the interrogation room, and it seems the prisoner is already prepared for your questioning—of course, there are enough instruments and supplies ready for your use.\nHowever, you need to be cautious, maybe at an exciting point in time, the positions of the hunter and the prey might reverse...\n[Hehe, you caught me~ How do you plan to interrogate me, Officer?]\n[If the punishment isn't harsh enough... I'll be quite disappointed.]"
},
	[612368]={ language="Changing armor to a costume tailored to what he might like, the girl kneels in a decorated play scene, the serene church blending with her prayers.\n[Hehe, this outfit was customized after studying your preferences for quite some time, does it match the look of a nun?]\n[So... What would you like to confess, or... ask from me?]"
},
	[612369]={ language="On a workday morning, it started raining. When you returned to the office, your personal secretary had already prepared today's work items and the schedule to meet with Operators.\nHowever, she forgot to bring an umbrella, just like you, and the indoor air conditioning [coincidentally] malfunctioned—the sweltering temperature rose between you and her, emotional tension simmered...\n[Before work... A little idle time, right? Since you'll be changing clothes, let me help with that, after all, isn't this a secretary's duty?]"
},
	[612370]={ language="[New Year's Renewal] series—Serene Hours\nDuring the blooming season of red plums, a sudden light snow added a touch of majesty to this winter scene. In the fragrance of plums, the astrologer gracefully supports a red umbrella as she approaches the pavilion, with a smile in her eyes. Seeing the absence of people, she eagerly wishes to invite you to admire the snow together.\n[Such a beautiful snowy landscape, is rarely described even in books... If you have the time, how about a walk with me?]\n[Day and night... Whenever, natural phenomena always put me in a good mood. I hope you can feel it too... More importantly, I want to be with you, just idly strolling in the courtyard, doing nothing will suffice.]"
},
	[612371]={ language="[New Year's Renewal] series—Dream Lullaby\nSpring is near, amidst the revival of life, Yunzhuan adorned in elegant attire evades the noise and sends a personal invitation just for you, waiting for your good news at the pavilion.\n[I told you our bond isn't shallow! Exhausted from waiting for you, I thought a little nap would be nice, then in the midst of a good dream, heard your footsteps... As soon as I opened my eyes, I saw you walking in the door, come and sit down, I've already prepared refreshments! Guess who I dreamed about?]"
},
	[612372]={ language="[New Year's Renewal] series—Silkened Portal\nMountains brocade-hued embrace the rouge-dyed dusk, as bridal red adorns one slow, while twilight tarries thus.\nYou tread softly through the corridor; the crystal curtain, fretted and swayed, chimes a crystalline refrain, unheard by her intent on the toilette displayed…Not until you lift the beaded strands aside, does she start, aware of your presence nigh..\n[I prepared meticulously for tonight with you... or rather, every single moment spent by your side deserves nothing less than my utmost care and dedication. Year after year, it remains so—through every passing season, I vow to remain by your side. Happy New Year, Linker]"
},
	[612373]={ language="[New Year's Renewal] series outfit—Moor Bloom\nWarmth returns to the sky, all things wake to spring's embrace. As you approach your rendezvous, the murmur of Tern reaches you — and in that moment, she too notes your arrival. A soft laugh escapes her, carrying boundless tenderness.\n[Halting the boat, I behold evening's glow; Drawing through water, I hear the song of oars… Ah, boundless is the breath of spring.] She softly repeats,\n[Having weathered countless storms upon the open sea, this placid lake strangely grants me peace… Perhaps because you draw near, Linker. Would you — drown in this night with me, and rest within a bower of bloom?]"
},
	[612374]={ language="Yan's customized Operator outfit, adjusted and made to reflect her personal wishes."
},
	[612375]={ language="Sweetheart Whispers series—Avian Rendezvous\nLooking at the date with bright red crosses drawing near, Crianca lies in bed taking deep breaths, trying hard to stay calm because it's so difficult to suppress the urge to see Linker.\nEmbraces, passionate kisses, turning everything around her upside down, merging her soul with his in that moment of perfect union.Such impatience leaves the mermaid waiting for him in the room overwhelmed. Yet at the same time, she's joyful, curious about what she'll face next in such a state.\n[Linker, I've waited for you too long, you won't let me down, will you?]"
},
	[612376]={ language="Sweetheart Whispers series—Quiet Midnight\nTo prepare gifts for tonight's date, Butterfly practically reviewed all the animations and movies she had seen and could use, but still couldn't find a good answer.\nFortunately, her friend Rose offered timely help, preventing her from being unprepared on the day.\n[Link... Linker, I... I'm not good at this...]\n[Rose said you would like this... umm... the fabric is a bit too little, I can't hide much......\nDeep breath, hiss—ha—I'm...I'm ready, Linker.\n]Please...please accept me.]"
},
	[612377]={ language="Sweetheart Whispers series—Languid Lean\nAn excellent knight always arms herself to the teeth before going into battle, [never go into battle unarmed] is the knights' iron rule—even on Valentine's Day.\nDawn started gathering information half a month before the day arrives. Here's the outcome: a meticulously planned layout, a tailored—trap.\nWhen you step into her study, what greets you is a smile unlike what a knight should display, like that of a witch.\n[You've seen through my thoughts ages ago, It's infuriating... but exhilarating too, because you came as promised.I appreciate your considerate heart not exposing my thoughts.]\n[The lock is open, Linker. Please...open me, read me, and take me into your heart.]"
},
	[612378]={ language="Sweetheart Whispers series—Snowfall Confession\nBurksomi's winter is long. The soft spring snow drifting through the quiet night only heightened Ling's restless unease.\nSince understanding this indescribable feeling within her, Ling had grown bolder in her actions – including tonight's invitation to Linker in her room.\nShe spent the day studying outfits, learning moves that made her cheeks flush. With a goal in mind, Ling embraced even the greatest challenge.\nSo, when Linker arrived as scheduled, the beauty lying prone on the bed, face crimson, whispered the sweet nothings she'd just practiced.\n[Let's have a contest that makes our hearts race, Linker. Until you defeat me... I won't let you leave.]"
},
	[612379]={ language="Delightful Merchant series outfit—Clumsy Maid\nSince the Skyborne Carrier established a rest area exclusively for Linker and Operators, many Operators with [other skills] opened shops there, with the cafe being the most popular and highly praised.\nAs a [trainee maid], Miss Butterfly was diligently learning how to provide the best service for Linker... though unfortunately, he always seemed to catch her clumsy moments.\n[S-Sorry, Linker... letting you see my clumsy side again...]\n[It's... cute like this? Ugh... I'll keep trying my best...]"
},
	[612380]={ language="Elegant Tales series—Sakura Dream\nBeneath the cherry tree, pink petals drifted like snow, brushing against Momiji's enchanting face. Her eyes, lively as spring water, held a hint of mischief and allure. When you appeared, her heart raced, yet she feigned composure, shaking off the blossoms that had escaped from the branches onto her fingertips.\n[Young Master, you came alone to admire the falling cherry blossoms with me?]\n[You wished... to see me? Hehe, it seems you and I share a certain... loneliness, do we not~?]"
},
	[612381]={ language="Elegant Tales series—Misty Plume\nWalking through the green shade, parting the bamboo grove, the clear spring murmured... There, wearing the ryokan's special attire, Tern sat beside the water, enveloped in the misty warmth...\nSeeing your approach, the girl offered a smile, her face slightly flushed against the steam—she had been waiting for some time.\n[Linker, it's chilly outside. Come in quickly and warm yourself.]\n[The spring's temperature is just right. Before you change and step in, how about chatting for a while? I've prepared some local delicacies for us to enjoy together.]"
},
	[612382]={ language="Elegant Tales series—Sapphire Cascade\nAs a hunter from the Arctic rarely seen in Leistance, Eucaly's every appearance must match her status – like staying in the most luxurious room at the Skyborne Carrier's hot spring ryokan-themed shop.\n[Only a place like this is worthy of me... Of course, as my companion, you too are worthy of sharing this room.]\n[Only one futon? Naturally, it's a single room... or are you worried about what others might think?]\n[I couldn't care less about others' opinions. On the contrary, I quite enjoy the feeling of being envied.]"
},
	[612395]={ language="What's the best way to ease her beloved investor's exhaustion after an all-nighter? There are many answers to this question, and Argo is willing to try them one by one until she finds the optimal solution—\n[I can't handle these troublesome documents for you, so I'll just have to find other ways to help you relax... Oh dear, given your status, it's not so strange to have a little maid by your side, is it? Or... do you find me too forward, Master? Perhaps I deserve a little punishment~]"
},
	[612397]={ language="You step into the empty office and close the door. Before you can even take a good look around, a crisp tap of a pointer cuts through the silence—\nThere she is, impeccably dressed, her gaze meeting yours. A stern look is etched on her face, but you alone can detect the hint of a smile playing beneath it.\nIt's a teacher's duty to guide her student. And it's the student's responsibility to learn the lesson thoroughly. So, my dear student, you're staying after class today. Consider it... extra credit to ensure you pass.”"
},
	[612391]={ language="As the lace of her snow-white gown whispers against the floor, Alicia clutches the bouquet, her heart fluttering like a captured bird.\nThe promise you two share finally blossoms into reality—today, she is certain she is the happiest girl in the world. Gazing at her transformed reflection, memories surge forth: moments of standing together through life and death, fragments of irreplaceable time. Even the air seems to shimmer with a newfound sweetness.\nHer eyes meet yours, seeing the same emotions reflected in your gaze. Then she sees it—the ring engraved with both your names, glimmering in your palm. Rising onto her toes, she lets her skirt bloom around her like a pristine flower and gently lays her hand over yours—\nFrom this day onward... she whispers, promise we'll stay together, always and forever."
},
	[612393]={ language="True to her sect's teachings, Yunzhuan travels far and wide. She isn't just spreading the word about Spark culture—she is living the ideal of Dual Harmony. So when she caught wind of the Carnival Night, she was the first to sign up!\nWell, hello there, Linker! This humble one has been waiting just for you~\nThis pose? Oh, this? It's my very own special technique! Let's call it my sneaky secret weapon for pulling off a surprise win!"
},
	[612894]={ language="Obtain it to unlock Flicker Preference series—Extra Lessons outfit accessory.\n\nThe temptation that leads astray."
},
	[612871]={ language="Obtain it to unlock Yunzhuan's Serenade series—Jade Rabbit's Divination outfit accessory.\n\nSince we know a millennium is but an instant, why not indulge in this moment of joy?"
},
	[612886]={ language="Obtain it to unlock Abyss Alicia's Oath of Hearts series—Flawless Affection outfit accessory.\n\nEvery step we've taken together leaves a trace behind."
},
	[612884]={ language="Obtain it to unlock Abyss Alicia's Oath of Hearts series—Flawless Affection outfit accessory.\n\nTo lose ourselves together in this melting night."
},
	[612880]={ language="Obtain it to unlock Abyss Alicia's Oath of Hearts series—Flawless Affection outfit accessory.\n\nTo reveal my true self to you."
},
	[612882]={ language="Obtain it to unlock Crag's School Days series—Enchanted Memories outfit accessory.\n\nWell, since nothing fits anymore... isn't it normal to make some changes?"
},
	[612877]={ language="Obtain it to unlock Abyss Alicia's Oath of Hearts series—Flawless Affection outfit accessory.\n\nIt shall appear at this very moment, as beautiful as my sincere heart."
},
	[612389]={ language="Even after spending considerable time in Lissugen, Lengjiao still struggles to face the scorching heat of summer with composure. Though her years living abroad have made her less conservative than her clansmen, she still hesitates before the summer outfits she secretly admires. Lengjiao desperately wished for something to convince her to try a different style.\nShe tentatively asked Taras for advice, but its reply made her cover her face in embarrassment:\n”Maybe telling yourself you're wearing it for someone special would be reason enough to take the leap?”\nWhether it was truly Taras's suggestion or just her own imagination, Lengjiao had to admit—it was reason enough to finally open her wardrobe.\n”I hope… he likes it…”"
},
	[612388]={ language="Despite already incorporating numerous functional components, Elsida still frowned at her prosthetic body. The reason was simple: she had received an invitation to a beach vacation in Leistance. Though fully confident in her charm, she knew the cold metallic limbs would clash with the swimsuit she had in mind. This was an invitation from the Linker himself—Elsida refused to let anyone outshine her because of a swimsuit.\nSo, she scoured every prosthetics market in Foden City, spending months of her savings, just to craft the perfect bionic limbs and synthetic skin that met her standards.\n”Linker, you can touch both of my legs—but be sure to tell me which side you prefer~”"
},
	[612963]={ language="Obtain it to unlock Lengjiao's Cool Coast series—Sunset Murmurs outfit accessory.\n\nEven the mist cannot conceal her whispers."
},
	[612970]={ language="Obtain it to unlock Lengjiao's Cool Coast series—Sunset Murmurs outfit accessory.\n\nThe tide brings shimmering words of affection."
},
	[612971]={ language="Obtain it to unlock Lengjiao's Cool Coast series—Sunset Murmurs outfit accessory.\n\nA secret, accidentally overheard."
},
	[612972]={ language="Obtain it to unlock Thunderock's Cool Coast series—Palm Nap outfit accessory.\n\nEven the sound of waves grows softer."
},
	[612973]={ language="Obtain it to unlock Thunderock's Cool Coast series—Palm Nap outfit accessory.\n\nShadow warmed by the summer sun."
},
	[612961]={ language="Obtain it to unlock Thunderock's Cool Coast series—Palm Nap outfit accessory.\n\nA sweet dream wrapped in sea foam."
},
	[612979]={ language="Obtain it to unlock Argo Preference series—Private Date outfit accessory.\n\nThe secret weapon prepared for this date~"
},
	[612401]={ language="Frost Jade was lost in thought, agonizing over what gift to prepare. Finding no inspiration, she headed to the mall, where she stumbled upon a treasure in a gift shop—a snow globe from before the Hundred Years' War of Shogger. The miniature landscape sealed within the glass sphere captivated her completely.\nA bold idea sparked in Frost Jade's mind. She took out her cherished silk fabric, meticulously trimming its edges, determined to weave her swirling emotions into it.\nWhen you arrived at the designated spot, puzzled by her message, you found her flustered, her cheek pressed against the glass as she gazed at you with shy intensity.\nI... accidentally locked myself in here, Linker. Could you... please open that door for me?"
},
	[612902]={ language="Obtain it to unlock Frost Jade's Sweetheart Whispers series—Veiled Glimpse outfit accessory.\n\nThe sweetest thoughts, lingering in the air."
},
	[612869]={ language="Obtain it to unlock Grenache's Silk Banquet series—Secret Chamber outfit accessory.\n\nFlickering like distant stars."
},
	[612878]={ language="Obtain it to unlock Grenache's Silk Banquet series—Secret Chamber outfit accessory.\n\nAs if the quiet night has come just for you."
},
	[612394]={ language="As the hostess of the Moonlight Kiss event, Grenache was conspicuously absent from tonight's banquet. That was, until you received an invitation sealed with a lipstick kiss. Following its clues, you arrived at a mysterious, secluded room.\nThere, you finally found the figure you'd been looking for. She was sipping wine, reclining on a sofa. Her high-slit gown draped carelessly to either side, and her languid demeanor left you momentarily dazed, your heart racing as if you were seeing her for the first time.\nYou came, Linker... There's fine wine on the table, prepared just for you. Will you join me for a drink?\nWhy here? Heh... Sometimes, I want to have you all to myself. There's so much I want to say... You'll indulge this little wish of mine, won't you?"
},
	[612396]={ language="Under the boundless moon in the deep of night, the wind and sand whisper outside the tent, while within, a warm, gentle breeze drifts. You part the layers of sheer curtains—Luna is already waiting. At the sight of you, a faint blush rises to her cheeks.\n'Tonight... I no longer wish to gaze at the moon. I wish for my eyes to hold only you.' A soft smile touches her lips. 'As for what comes next... just as it is written in stories, I am certain you understand the longing in my heart. Shall we share the same thought?'"
},
	[612402]={ language="Lilira anxiously watches the wall clock in her room, smoothing the non-existent wrinkles on her clothes over and over in the mirror, yet her restless heart refuses to settle.\n'Patience, Lilira, patience. Be brave. Prepare a surprise for the Linker.'\nThe girl lies on her bed, fiddling with the various little props she's gathered while murmuring to herself, completely unaware that you've seen it all through the slightly ajar door.\nA mischievous smile crosses your face as you quietly push the door open."
},
	[612987]={ language="Obtain it to unlock Luna's Crimson Serenade series—Sleepy Bunny outfit accessory.\n\nTo be a bit more like a rabbit, to be a bit closer to you."
},
	[612865]={ language="Obtain it to unlock Luna's Wonderland Encounter series—Lunar Silhouette outfit accessory.\n\nCountless reflected moonbeams, each one a gaze I turn toward you."
},
	[612892]={ language="Obtain it to unlock Luna's Wonderland Encounter series—Sleepless Spring Night outfit accessory.\n\nDance freely under the scarlet moon."
},
	[612904]={ language="Obtain it to unlock Lilira's Sweetheart Whispers series—Feline Enchantress outfit accessory.\n\nNo concealment, no pretense—utterly frank and direct."
},
	[612995]={ language="Obtain it to unlock Thunderock's New Year's Renewal series— Brightveil·Quivering Shadow accessory.\n\nThe first tremble of my heart, for you."
},
	[612404]={ language="Determined to give Linker a dessert baked with her own hands, Crianca quietly plotted an extra surprise to make your heart race—rather than just a simple treat, perhaps transforming herself into an irresistible [sweetheart] would hit the mark.\nBut her careful preparations took an unexpected turn. With a startled cry, when you pushed open the door, you saw milk tracing slow paths down her skin and cream dotted across her figure. That unforeseen moment of disarray made your heart pound even faster than any dessert could.\n[To let Linker see me like this... Ugh, I want to bury my face in the cream... Huh? Y-you want to... lick it clean...?!]"
},
	[612405]={ language="A magic-deprived witch stumbles into your castle. Powerless, she must obey your commands and please you in exchange for your aid.\nThough... perhaps she's starting to enjoy it?\n[I've put on this outfit like you asked... What else do you want from me?]\n[I have to hold the rope in my own mouth? You...!]\n[Fine... I'll do it! But once I escape, I'll never let you get away with this!]"
},
	[612908]={ language="Obtain it to unlock Crianca's Sweetheart Whispers series—Pink Patisserie outfit accessory.\n\nRich in flavor, white as snow and smooth as satin."
},
	[612890]={ language="Obtain it to unlock Argo Dessert Service series—Morning Tale outfit accessory.\n\nMilk-flavored morning."
},
	[612910]={ language="Obtain it to unlock Karanissa's Witch series—Castle Secret accessory.\n\nWhether it's punishment or reward—neither she nor you can say for sure."
},
	[625003]={ language="Obtain it to unlock Lilira's Sweetheart Whispers series—Feline Enchantress Interaction Scenario.\n\nExplore the 'secrets' that belong to her within the 'Ms. Kitty's' meticulously adorned little home..."
},
	[625002]={ language="Obtain it to unlock Abyss Alicia's Oath of Hearts series— the interactive scenario of Flawless Affection.\n\nWhispers of affection linger by your ear, leading you to another Star Corner that belongs only to you and her."
},
	[613011]={ language="Open to obtain core Models for parts 1-4 of [Attack Boost] Model set.\n\n<color=#404548>A small Model supply box distributed by Leistance War Supplies Department. Due to staff negligence when placing the items, it's impossible to know if there are urgently needed things inside.</color>"
},
