	[617033]={ language="Sofa made based on a description by an Operator about penguins. Its design is unique but the backrest is a bit hard."
},
	[617034]={ language="Aquarium imitating ocean environment and water pressure, with jellyfish gracefully swimming among corals."
},
	[617035]={ language="Designer got inspired seeing a whale spray, but as furniture, it seems lacking... something?"
},
	[617036]={ language="An elegant art piece freezing the dynamic of dolphins gracefully and freely leaping, but why are dolphins crying?"
},
	[617037]={ language="A wall made of solid wood panels, with a faint scent of wood when close. However, its moisture-proof effect is quite poor."
},
	[617038]={ language="Wood beams crafted from logs, starlight-like lighting resembles stars keeping watch in the night sky."
},
	[617039]={ language="Solid wood flooring, it's best to change shoes before entering the room, otherwise, it's easy to dirty it."
},
	[617040]={ language="Aesthetic and cozy tent, your secret base."
},
	[617041]={ language="Crafted with wood and fabric, looks petite but holds a lot.\n[Don't store anything other than food inside! How many times do I have to say?]"
},
	[617042]={ language="Chair perfect for reclining, best way to enjoy life: total relaxation."
},
	[617043]={ language="Light camping chair, even in the most hostile outdoor environments, give yourself a break."
},
	[617044]={ language="Coffee cup, long bench, a like-minded companion, a warm conversation."
},
	[617045]={ language="Portable shelf, shouldn't place too heavy items, it's somewhat unstable…"
},
	[617046]={ language="Wooden table for placing anything.\n[To rest properly, of course, eat well, drink well.]"
},
	[617047]={ language="Smokeless grill for camping, fresh meat dances on lively flames, irresistibly attractive to everyone."
},
	[617048]={ language="Smiley-faced heater—it is a heater... right?"
},
	[617049]={ language="Rattan crafted hanging chair, soft and comfortable, petite Operators might use it as a bed."
},
	[617050]={ language="Rattan crafted parasol, whether rainproof is unknown, but excellent for sunshade."
},
	[617051]={ language="Fireplace good for setting ambiance and heating, but also for grilling…\n[Anyone using the fireplace for grilling?! Own up now!]"
},
	[617052]={ language="Highly detailed perforated organizer board, suitable for hanging camping gear.\n[Just afraid gear will gather dust left untouched.]"
},
	[617053]={ language="Potted plant with unknown species, seems edible.\n[Dare you eat a cactus?!]"
},
	[617054]={ language="Potted plant with unknown species, seems difficult to maintain.\n[Stop watering so much I said!]"
},
	[617055]={ language="Potted plant with unknown species, seems unlikely to wilt."
},
	[617056]={ language="Decorative plant, fits anywhere without being jarring."
},
	[617057]={ language="Thriving vine plant, quickly covering the wall left unchecked."
},
	[617058]={ language="Widely cultivated plant globally, planting a couple could enrich leisure."
},
	[617060]={ language="Wall turned to look like cream, sweet and inviting, releasing a fragrant aroma difficult not to like."
},
	[617061]={ language="Grid floor made of various pink tones.\n[Why all pink grid tiles? Well, designer's preference!]"
},
	[617062]={ language="Ceiling patterned like cake decorations, dizziness might occur with prolonged gazing."
},
	[617063]={ language="Food and sleep are essential, every Operator sleeping on it can enter sweet dream state."
},
	[617064]={ language="Cake-shaped table, beware, it's not edible."
},
	[617065]={ language="Sofa inspired by waffle biscuits, cookie pillows are the highlight."
},
	[617066]={ language="Long table styled like a chocolate cake, mousse highlights create a unique impression.\n[Don't bite it!]"
},
	[617067]={ language="Counter full of cakes, feast your heart out, but avoid overindulging—cavities not covered by work injury insurance."
},
	[617068]={ language="Macaron-shaped chair, sitting on it brings an incredibly pleasant mood.\n[I'm a green macaron!]"
},
	[617069]={ language="Macaron-shaped chair, sitting on it feels as if they might collapse under you.\n[I'm a red macaron!]"
},
	[617070]={ language="Macaron-shaped chair, sitting on it inspires blueberry cravings.\n[I'm a blue macaron!]"
},
	[617071]={ language="Macaron-shaped chair, sitting on it inspires ice cream cone cravings.\n[I'm... a yellow macaron!]"
},
	[617072]={ language="Gingerbread man holiday decor, enhancing sweet atmosphere.\n[Even gingerbread men come in pairs?!]"
},
	[617073]={ language="Has various uses besides decoration—absolutely not edible."
},
	[617074]={ language="Only for decoration, not edible."
},
	[617075]={ language="Strawberry aroma wafts from it occasionally."
},
	[617076]={ language="Chocolate aroma wafts occasionally but it's not edible."
},
	[617077]={ language="Live in a big glass jar, colorful and transparent like magic balls, store lots of sweetness."
},
	[617078]={ language="Furniture a certain Operator loves dearly, each glance makes her crave strawberry ice cream."
},
	[617079]={ language="Candy decor visibly delightful, smells like strawberry and tangerine."
},
	[617080]={ language="Candy decor visibly delightful, smells like mango and apple."
},
	[617081]={ language="Towering cake sculpture, its aroma alone captivates countless girls."
},
	[617082]={ language="Symbol of maritime leadership, steering wheel of sea voyages, but no one knows why it's here."
},
	[617083]={ language="A blue and white lifesaver ring, essential for landlubbers."
},
	[617084]={ language="Jellyfish-shaped lamp, lifelike jellyfish and warm glow create relaxing atmosphere, ideal for unwinding."
},
	[617085]={ language="Blue glossy round table, places numerous items—by the way, fish in the table's goldfish bowl are alive."
},
	[617086]={ language="Just an ordinary chair, sitting... fairly comfy?"
},
	[617087]={ language="Indoor circular large bathtub, spacious and comfortable, ensuring full bath enjoyment."
},
	[617088]={ language="[TapTap special coated furniture, trying to give Linker a more relaxed home environment~]\nHanging screen displaying time, calendar, weather, etc., sometimes used for meetings."
},
	[617089]={ language="[TapTap special coated furniture, trying to give Linker a more relaxed home environment~]\nA soft white sofa that makes you want to lie down and rest as soon as you sit on it."
},
	[617090]={ language="[4399 Game Box special painted furniture, trying to give Linker a more relaxed home environment~] \nThe wall screen can show multiple information like time, calendar, weather, and can sometimes be used for meetings."
},
	[617091]={ language="[Special decoration furniture from Good Games, trying to give Linker a more relaxed home environment.]\nA wall screen that can display various information such as time, calendar, and weather, sometimes can be used for meetings."
},
	[617092]={ language="[Mumu special painted furniture, trying to give Linker a more relaxed home environment.] \n[A wall display that can show various information such as time, calendar, and weather, sometimes can be used for meetings.]"
},
	[617093]={ language="[Bilibili special themed furniture, trying to give Linker a more relaxing home environment.]\nThe standard lab benches used in most research facilities are extremely practical."
},
	[617094]={ language="Red Table"
},
	[617095]={ language="[Bilibili special painted furniture, aiming to provide Linker with a more relaxed home environment.]\nThe desk for daily work can also be used for reading, playing video games, eating... or even jumping up there to dance."
},
	[617096]={ language="Red Striped Table"
},
	[617097]={ language="The regular dartboard set up to match the tavern style, but the accompanying darts often go missing."
},
	[617098]={ language="The violin hanging on the wall, can't be played; it's just decoration."
},
	[617099]={ language="Vintage metal paired with gentle candlelight, casts bright shadows on the walls, adding a warm ambiance to the space."
},
	[617100]={ language="Windows made from logs, show the scenery outside when opened."
},
	[617101]={ language="A retro-style bar counter made of raw wood. If you drink too much, make sure not to start any arguments here, or you'll definitely be kicked out by the bartender."
},
	[617102]={ language="A simple wooden round stool without a backrest is bad for your spine if you sit for a long time."
},
	[617103]={ language="A simple wooden chair, though it has a backrest, is not suitable for sitting for long periods."
},
	[617104]={ language="Long table made from timber, polished smoothly."
},
	[617105]={ language="A simple wooden round table, without complex patterns, but very practical, capable of accommodating multiple people for dining together."
},
	[617106]={ language="Classic style mechanical motorcycles, are a romantic favorite for many Croatians, perfect for any spot in a tavern."
},
	[617107]={ language="Beautifully designed decoration aimed to showcase the scene of a train speeding down the track, allowing everyone to reminisce about the old days."
},
	[617109]={ language="It looks like a brick wall built brick by brick, but it's actually a wallpaper."
},
	[617110]={ language="The ceiling made from logs paired with copper piping decor is nothing unusual; after all, it's quite common in Kroward."
},
	[617111]={ language="There are all sorts of floor designs, but Krowardians always choose models made of solid wood."
},
	[617120]={ language="A handmade woven round stool that turns into a bamboo basket capable of holding lots of items when you lift the cushion."
},
	[617121]={ language="The pattern on the hanging painting is very abstract, and it seems to be a very ancient tribal design."
},
	[617122]={ language="Artworks filled with mystery and a strange vibe seem like a window to another world."
},
	[617123]={ language="The pattern is unique, but every household in the Sleipnir tribe has a tapestry like this, as if it represents their belief."
},
	[617124]={ language="The combination of a wooden lamp stand and tube brings a natural and elegant fusion to the space, creating a uniquely refined atmosphere."
},
	[617125]={ language="The tribe's symbol of faith carries on their reverence for nature and life, adding a mysterious and awe-inspiring vibe to the room."
},
	[617126]={ language="A fresh white table usually needs some greenery to bring it to life."
},
	[617127]={ language="The drums that produce an ethereal sound are thought by most people in the tribe to be echoes from deep in the wilderness."
},
	[617128]={ language="A simple wardrobe for storing clothes."
},
	[617129]={ language="Walls that can project the image of the Sleipnir tribe, makes it seem like you can step right into your homeland."
},
	[617130]={ language="Feel the tranquility of the night sky indoors, spending peaceful moments with the star-studded sky."
},
	[617131]={ language="All the wood was transported from the Sleipnir tribe. If you get close, you can still catch a whiff of the wood's fragrance, though it seems like no one intentionally does that."
},
	[617132]={ language="Randomly drop all set types of Model"
},
	[617133]={ language="Randomly drop all set types of Model"
},
	[617134]={ language="Randomly drop all set types of Model"
},
	[617135]={ language="A custom-made bookshelf from the Astoria family, filled with several biographies of past heads of the family, along with the most comprehensive collection of astrology books."
},
	[617136]={ language="Astrology instruments frequently appear in the Vilatria family. Even in the modern Taino world, the Vilatria people still maintain their cultural rituals. \n—Birth charts can also be used for divination; if you believe, it works, if not, it doesn't."
},
	[617137]={ language="Soft, comfortable, and a big bed where you can see the starry sky overhead.\n—— [Honestly, my neck just feels a bit sore from sleeping.]"
},
	[617138]={ language="The rug made by Vilatria textile workshop, often appears in noble homes and is highly praised for its glow-in-the-dark star pattern design."
},
	[617139]={ language="Every tick of the clock guides Vilatria people in the right direction.\n—Except when it's broken."
},
	[617140]={ language="Probably used for cooking, but there are some people with special professions who love this kind of kitchenware."
},
	[617141]={ language="The crystal ball on the coffee table is the most expensive part of the table."
},
	[617142]={ language="Even if you stand on it, you won't actually be summoned away by any wizard."
},
	[617143]={ language="The guest chairs crafted to the specifications of the Astelia family, each intricately carved with the family emblem.\n—Anyone who comes is a guest; please have a seat."
},
	[617144]={ language="What kind of destiny do you want? Let's have a good talk about it."
},
	[617145]={ language="The sofa designed with Vilatria aesthetic style, was once widely praised around the world."
},
	[617146]={ language="Curtains made from Vilatria's own textile materials have great light-blocking properties. It's said that sunlight refracts through the curtains, emitting a hint of starlight."
},
	[617147]={ language="Feel the blue tranquility indoors."
},
	[617148]={ language="It's easy to invite friends to join at the long table for games; nothing is more fun than everyone starting a game together. \n—Enough talk, log into the game!"
},
	[617149]={ language="A comfy couch where you can easily invite friends to sit and play around the table. Nothing's more fun than starting a game together.\n—Enough talk, log in to the game!"
},
	[617150]={ language="When you're tired, you can rest on this soft bed and maybe play a game walkthrough video to lull yourself to sleep."
},
	[617151]={ language="A round stool designed for long gaming sessions, so you won't get tired playing games all day."
},
	[617152]={ language="Party games are incomplete without game props, and high scorers always get cheers from others!"
},
	[617153]={ language="The starry ceiling was designed based on historical images and book descriptions, and it includes the popular star dot matrix from Vilatria, making this furniture widely liked by Vilatria residents."
},
	[617154]={ language="A pure black floor without any stripes; if you're unsure which floor to buy, just go with this one."
},
	[617155]={ language="No firewood burning in the fireplace, but as long as there's fire in the heart, you can feel the warmth—probably."
},
	[617156]={ language="Carpet with pumpkin images and a variety of other patterns, the soft surface is spotless."
},
	[617157]={ language="A stone coffin that can fit a large creature's body; it's said that someone once used it as a place to sleep, but who would sleep in there?"
},
	[617158]={ language="The ceiling with pumpkin-head style lampshades casts shadows of pumpkins when lit.\nIt's said to reveal ghosts that couldn't enter heaven, but no buyer has ever confirmed this feature."
},
	[617159]={ language="The chair covered with a ghost hood still feels hard.\nOnce you sit down, don't look back, that smiling face is watching you."
},
	[617160]={ language="The floor uses a dense grid design, sturdy and durable, not only bearing the weight of real objects but also allowing some unnatural creatures to step on it."
},
	[617161]={ language="A soft bed designed like a pumpkin head, lying on it you can smell the aroma of pumpkin."
},
	[617162]={ language="The walls engraved with patterns fitting the festive atmosphere once had buyers report hearing cries from within them at night."
},
	[617163]={ language="3D decorations modeled after tree monsters from fairy tales, aiming to fulfill kids' fantasies about fairy tales.\n—That's right, it moves."
},
	[617164]={ language="Wall decorations modeled after tree monsters from fairy tales, aiming to fulfill children's fantasy of fairy tales.\n—Don't write blessings on the tags, write Curse!"
},
	[617165]={ language="A desk full of ciphertext and ancient books, concealing many unsolved mysteries of the world."
},
	[617166]={ language="Stacked up vertical pumpkins.\n—Candy? What age still needs candy? If you don't give me your soul, I'll eat you!"
},
	[617167]={ language="Stacked pumpkins placed vertically.\n—You're a pumpkin, he's a pumpkin, so who am I?"
},
	[617168]={ language="Sitting by the fireplace, falling asleep by the warm fire, perhaps you'll wake up to find your socks stuffed with gifts, who knows?"
},
	[617169]={ language="It is said to be a weaving technique from Lengjiao's hometown, purely handmade.\n[It should be the most expensive thing in this room.]"
},
	[617170]={ language="I heard that Santa Claus came from far away riding it.\n[No, Sleipnir is not a reindeer! It doesn't pull a sleigh.]"
},
	[617171]={ language="To make the room more fitting for the vibe, each colored light was installed manually.\n[Can someone handle Lorila! She's going after the colored lights again!]"
},
	[617172]={ language="[Sitting up isn't very comfortable, but it's bearable for the delicious food at the dinner party.]"
},
	[617173]={ language="It creaks when you step on it, which feels a bit like being in a cabin in the winter forest.\n[Please change your shoes before entering!]"
},
	[617174]={ language="A soft and comfy big bed, the fresh scent of mistletoe, and a thick blanket—can you have a good dream on a snowy winter night?"
},
	[617175]={ language="They say the raw material is an evergreen tree that grows in the Arctic, but it just looks like wood grain wallpaper.\n[Solid wood is very expensive, just a symbolic gesture will do.]—a logistics staff member explained."
},
	[617176]={ language="The statue decoration mimicking soldiers isn't quite mainstream in terms of craftsmanship or materials, but it still has a small audience."
},
	[617177]={ language="[How long does it take to finish reading a book?]\nProbably a long time! Because Leistance's story updates every day, and every tomorrow is full of anticipation."
},
	[617178]={ language="The Operators prepared a dinner together, filled with foods from their hometowns, including some with unique flavors.\n[Warning! Don't eat too much candy!]"
},
	[617179]={ language="[Yuanya has no idea what's hidden inside! Do not open it.]\nSince she already said that, it's better to stay away from that cabinet."
},
	[617180]={ language="Ginger… candy… Why can these two things be combined into food?! Wait, did it just move?"
},
	[617181]={ language="A snow globe with a snowman inside supposedly has the ability to play music according to the instructions.\n[Want to change the song?]"
},
	[617182]={ language="One of the props to set the Christmas vibe.\n[Yellow carrots, red hats, candy canes, gift boxes... Oh! Still missing a broom!]"
},
	[617183]={ language="Without this fir tree, the Christmas would be incomplete. \n—said by someone from AIMBS."
},
	[617184]={ language="Crafted by a skillful Operator."
},
	[617185]={ language="Someone ran two store streets to find the vintage clock, really adds to the holiday spirit."
},
	[617186]={ language="Under the light, it sparkles like stars."
},
	[617187]={ language="Its beauty is breathtaking, and sitting on it is really comfortable.\n[There's a small table on top that looks perfect for playing chess with Linker. I hope it won't be rejected.]"
},
	[617188]={ language="Lie down, stretch, feel the relaxation wash over you, just close your eyes and have a good sleep!"
},
	[617189]={ language="[Feels like I can lay it flat and use it to store things!]\nNo, don't do that kind of thing!"
},
	[617190]={ language="A small footstool placed next to the bed or desk is not only practical but also very attractive."
},
	[617191]={ language="Various snacks prepared for the Operators' gathering, although their tastes were considered in advance, unexpected situations still occurred. \n[This is so bitter! What kind of drink is this?]"
},
	[617192]={ language="That's a very rare fabric! I heard that even in the Far East, it's sold at a high price.\n[What, you mean these patterns are woven with silk thread?]"
},
	[617193]={ language="A dresser with strong storage capabilities, you can even smell the scent of wood up close.\n[1, 2, 3... Let me count how many drawers there are; no idea what's inside.]"
},
	[617194]={ language="The vase and the Epiphyllum inside were gifts from a friendly AIMBS, and it's hard to say which is more precious."
},
	[617195]={ language="The thin gauze cover emits a hazy yet warm light, changing the atmosphere of the room.\n[Please be careful with certain AIMBS. There are candles inside the lampshade, watch out for injuries.]"
},
	[617196]={ language="Although it can somewhat block views and protect privacy, its existence seems to pique the curiosity of some Operators even more."
},
	[617197]={ language="It's that in the Far East, holding an umbrella for someone else has some special meanings."
},
	[617198]={ language="Wooden furniture that's both stylish and practical, allows you to place anything your heart desires, making even your mood better."
},
	[617199]={ language="It's also one of the traditional customs of Spark. \n[Let's try some paper cutting tonight!]"
},
	[617200]={ language="It's also one of the traditional customs of Spark. \n[Let's try some paper cutting tonight!]"
},
	[617201]={ language="It's also one of the traditional customs of Spark. \n[Let's try some paper cutting tonight!]"
},
	[617202]={ language="It's also one of the traditional customs of Spark. \n[Let's try some paper cutting tonight!]"
},
	[617203]={ language="Recently, a weaving trend hit Leistance, and this is one of their finest products, generously shared by its owner."
},
	[617204]={ language="A folding fan painted with mountain scenery, seems like a high-end item imported from Spark. \n[Oh, there's no clear outline, yet it looks just like mountains, so magical.]"
},
	[617205]={ language="A unique landscape that truly amazes, every piece said to be one of a kind. \n[Wow, it's taller than me.]"
},
	[617206]={ language="Roofs inspired by Eastern techniques, perfect for the current gathering. \n[Are you sure these wooden boards won't fall?]"
},
	[617207]={ language="The characters on the wall were written by an Eastern visitor, reproduced through printing, bought by keen commercial merchants and made into wallpapers. They're selling fast, almost out of stock."
},
	[617208]={ language="The distinctive patchwork wooden floor is stable and makes that unique wooden sound when you step on it. \n[No big jumps allowed!]"
},
	[617209]={ language="When venturing out at night, ensure you have it with you. The wildlands are dangerous—stay vigilant at all times."
},
	[617210]={ language="A cushion that looks incredibly soft, perfect for resting against when tired.\nA necessary disclaimer: Please use indoor seating correctly. Climbing is prohibited."
},
	[617211]={ language="It boasts six petals as soft as silk, resembling a girl's heart secrets, shared only with those who matter.\nSo, Linker, are you free today?"
},
	[617212]={ language="A newly cultivated variety from the Selevie Third Biological Research Institute, obtained in advance by Linker through some private connection. It's said that very rare specimens with only four petals carry a beautiful symbolism."
},
	[617213]={ language="A classic never goes out of style. Wait for a nice day and go for a picnic together!"
},
	[617214]={ language="A piece from a past crafting session, generously donated by its owner.\nCount me in for the next gathering!"
},
	[617215]={ language="Three round chicks came to see the fun.\nWhere's the excitement in Leistance anyway?"
},
	[617216]={ language="Packed with clothes, food, and sleeping bags.\nI hope tonight's floor can fit all these sleeping bags."
},
	[617217]={ language="A temporarily set-up swing, brought in from outside. You can sway on it and doze off into dreams."
},
	[617218]={ language="‌One, Two, Three, Cheese!‌\nLet's capture this moment of beauty with it."
},
	[617219]={ language="With it around, the room stays brightly lit even at night."
},
	[617220]={ language="Picnics and barbecues are the perfect match.\nSlow down eating, save some for me!"
},
	[617221]={ language="Let morning glories climb up the walls, letting spring light pour into the heart.\nLet you sing, let you pause.\nFriends, let's enjoy spring together."
},
	[617222]={ language="A rainbow is the sky's smile, a reflection of dreams.\nCan we find a way to keep it forever, meow?"
},
	[617223]={ language="I have some little Duukeys I can never do without. One day, I'll pick a mascot and send it to run for election."
},
	[617224]={ language="A very popular item in Leistance, frequently sold out.\nThis design looks a bit familiar, doesn't it?"
},
	[617225]={ language="Bought from a souvenir shop, reportedly with official Spark authorization.\nYou said 'official authorization'... what does that mean?"
},
	[617226]={ language="A soft felt floor to step on. Remember to change shoes when entering."
},
	[617227]={ language="Look up at the sky and clouds right away.\nWanna lie on the floor and stargaze together tonight?"
},
	[617228]={ language="‌Dance to the beat!‌ Shake it! Move it!"
},
	[617229]={ language="A glass of champagne costs 648 Taino Currency. It's double the price here. There's one, two, three… Lost track of how many there are!"
},
	[617230]={ language="Should it be rock music or classical? The Operators are split into two factions over this."
},
	[617231]={ language="No one entering the bar can ignore it. The glass bottles glint with a cold, gorgeous shine under the dim, cozy lights, their exorbitant price tag putting them out of reach for many."
},
	[617232]={ language="The plant kept in the room for greenery occasionally gets watered with leftover alcohol by the Operators, yet it still clings to life tenaciously."
},
	[617233]={ language="A masterful bartender crafts any drink the guests desire here.\nOf course, there are also the occasional less skilled ones—like this drink called Prank. Dare you take a sip?"
},
	[617234]={ language="Sturdy leather booths that can seat quite a few people, but mind you—no lying down allowed.\nWhat happens if you do?\nYou'll get thrown out!"
},
	[617235]={ language="The leather seats can be raised or lowered to suit most Operators' needs.\nBut even at its lowest, kids still can't sit on it!\nCould it be that... this place is off-limits to children?\n...Right!"
},
	[617236]={ language="The ice bucket from the all-you-can-drink area somehow ended up here."
},
	[617237]={ language="Friendly reminder: Please do not place heavy objects on the spotlights or climb on them carelessly."
},
	[617238]={ language="The friend under the spotlight—shout out your dreams!\nOf course, this isn't a wishing well; you'll still have to make your dreams come true yourself."
},
	[617239]={ language="There's a Foden City urban legend: On a pitch-black night, a guest spent a small fortune to treat everyone in the bar that night, securing the privilege of a custom-made sign with their name.\nSo this is how that special sign came to be? How do you read it? 'You-kah-ray?' Is that right? And why is it in the Linker's hands now?"
},
	[617240]={ language="The old sign, no longer in use, has been moved to a less conspicuous spot."
},
	[617241]={ language="A place of joy and indulgence."
},
	[617242]={ language="A highly individualistic sign, suspected to be a personal item of a certain Operator."
},
	[617243]={ language="The walls, made of cutting-edge tech materials, double as an air conditioning system and can be remotely controlled to display patterns.\nAs for pattern control? That's a perk for the annual top-tier VIP."
},
	[617244]={ language="According to the construction files, the ceiling is made of a billion glass fibers.\nThat many? Really?"
},
	[617245]={ language="It's said to be crafted from natural marble mined from incredibly deep caverns and meticulously pieced together—though when you ask insiders, they just give you a cryptic smile.\nThat it's expensive is certain, though."
},
	[617246]={ language="Warning: This table has a maximum weight capacity of 40kg. Do not place overweight items on it; damages will be billed at cost.\nThat's an oddly specific rule... Come to think of it, would there even be anything that heavy here?"
},
	[617247]={ language="The oversized statue placed at the heart of the venue, the centerpiece for photos—even a few AIM Operators tried to fly up and touch it...\n—Furniture for dorms."
},
	[617248]={ language="The sturdy, straight marble pillars.\n—Furniture for dorms."
},
	[617249]={ language="The ceiling of the venue features specially designed lighting fixtures."
},
	[617250]={ language="The white walls have been freshly repainted.\nDo not touch."
},
	[617251]={ language="Checkered tiles, retro and elegant."
},
