	[612301]={ language="[Lingering Leisure] series—Wind's Murmur.\nClassic casual style for outings, made with quality materials, suitable for any activity under bright artificial sunlight.\nHow to wisely use the fleeting holiday hours is quite a challenge for Lilira—but anyway, first put busy work aside and enjoy the restful time tending plants in the small garden.\n[Even though it's just artificial sunshine and blue sky, these plants are absolutely real. Please wait a moment, I'll be right over after watering them.]"
},
	[612302]={ language="[Lingering Leisure] series—Unbound Chaos.\nBest choice for a leisurely holiday, shedding constraints, enjoy the short vacation in the most relaxed state. It's often worn by Merlot when roaming the streets.\n[yo~life is a circle, I return to the starting point again... huh? When did you arrive? Listen to this new song I just found, it's really good! No sound? Uh... hahaha, of course there's no sound because I was kidding you, bleh bleh bleh~]"
},
	[612303]={ language="[Lingering Leisure] series—Coffee Break.\nCrafted with sharp tailoring to create a lightweight style, reduce unnecessary constraints and help you achieve perfect balance between work and life.\n[...Ah, hello. Yes, it's break time now... I'm just doing some light reading, it helps me recover. It's getting a bit cold, would you like a cup of hot coffee?]"
},
	[612304]={ language="[Lingering Leisure] series—Type-Zero.\nA smart fit racing suit paired with the rare TypeX-00 motorcycle—a swift silhouette racing through the street, leaving a stylish shadow that draws cheers and calls from the Ravend—if you could see her face under the helmet, you'd be amazed by Karanissa's beauty and poise.\n[Racing can free my mind and body, but I advise you not to imitate lightly.]"
},
	[612305]={ language="[Lingering Leisure] series—Tipsy Holiday.\nCustom-made from [Tailored Aristocrat Outfit], each cut crafted by artisans, pure fabric that's high-grade without being showy, elegant with a touch of elegance. For Lycosha, possessing the perfect image fulfills a certain inner desire.\n[For me, the body is both a home and refuge, isn't it just natural to equip our home properly? You say I'm drunk? No way—just slightly tipsy.]"
},
	[612306]={ language="[Lingering Leisure] series—Wanderer.\nDesigned for traveling Promian people, it adapts traditional Promian attire by discarding bulky fur, using soft special materials with dynamic cuts, combined with traditional patterns to shine with unique fashion vitality."
},
	[612307]={ language="Dawn's expansion Operator outfit—Memories of Vilatria.\nDawn's former attire during her time with the Vilatria Knight Order, representing her earlier days, growth, and pride—all melted away like snow—with these clothes are the only reminder she was once part of the Vilatria Stellar Knights."
},
