	[120121]={ language="\nA donkey-shaped combat support robot developed by Leistance, equipped with specific tactical support AI, can optimize the Operator's attack strategy instructions.\n Called Mighty purely for the designer's quirks."
},
	[120122]={ language="\nA donkey-shaped combat support robot developed by Leistance, equipped with specific tactical support AI, can optimize the Operator's position defensive strategy.\n Bizarrely dubbed [Duukey Ditz] despite its tactical genius–a testament to the designer's wicked sense of humor."
},
	[120123]={ language="\nA donkey-shaped combat support robot developed by Leistance, equipped with specific tactical support AI, can optimize Operator's Support strategies.\n Though [Duukey Cutie] delivers flawless combat support, its emotional AI is surprisingly shy, constantly shrinking away to seek cover mid-battle.\n—On your feet, Cutie!"
},
