},
	[120129]={ language="\nA donkey-shaped combat support robot developed by Leistance, equipped with specific tactical support AI, can optimize Operator's breakthrough strategies.\n [Duukey Valiant] was crafted with only two words in mind: charge and battle."
},
	[120130]={ language="\nA donkey-shaped combat support robot developed by Leistance, equipped with specific tactical support AI, can optimize the Operator's instant healing strategies.\n Its AI not only aids Operators but also benefits plant growth, so it's often placed in the garden when not in battle."
},
	[120131]={ language="\nA donkey-shaped combat support robot developed by Leistance, equipped with specific tactical support AI, can optimize Operator's all-out attack strategies.\n This model was supposed to be named [Duukey Hammer] but due to the oversight of research staff, during patent application the name [Duukey Tank] was used."
},
	[120132]={ language="\nA donkey-shaped combat support robot developed by Leistance, equipped with specific tactical support AI, can optimize Operator's rapid attack strategies.\n Among the same period donkey-shaped support robots in development, this model is the only one not named using the [Duukey Something] format, reason unknown."
