	[78081]={ language="After finishing the area exploration, you returned to the temporary mission camp for a good rest, but there's still some business to handle in front of you, your choice is..."
},
	[78082]={ language="You and your squad encountered a small merchant stall during the exploration. It's more like a rag spread on the ground with [junk] scattered on it, but some of these items might actually be valuable. Will you take a chance on it?"
},
	[78083]={ language="You and your squad passed by a mercenary camp, where the mercenaries are relaxing. Upon seeing you, they ask, [Want to try your luck?] In response, you ultimately choose to..."
},
	[78084]={ language="You and your squad completed all investigation tasks for a block, after uploading the report, headquarters sent the supply items promptly, but due to management reasons, the sent supply items seem somewhat different from what you expected, you ultimately chose..."
},
	[78085]={ language="You and your squad encountered a mysterious traveling store during exploration, the mysterious store owner with a veiled face waits for your visit—whether buying or selling, you seem to get some good deals here, do you want to try?"
},
	[78086]={ language="You and your squad passed by a remnant's camp during exploration, feeling The remnant culture—they offer you supplies and hope for some bartering, indicating you can pay a small fee to use their radio and hope you can help them with a few extra commissions..."
},
	[78087]={ language="You arrived at the site of abnormal Void Particles concentration, finding a strangely formed Void Particles Crystal floating in the air—a Void Particles Crystal unlike any you've seen, collecting it rashly may cause contamination, will you..."
},
	[78088]={ language="You arrived at the site of abnormal Void Particles concentration—on the sandy ground, a poor remnant lies there breathless, beside him, a Xenocryst emits a faint glow, without containment equipment on site, your choice is..."
},
	[78089]={ language="You entered the wreckage of [Saradine] and began your search, eventually discovering several well-preserved storage tanks amidst the wreckage—there are traces of spilled liquid Stellar Crystal, someone seems to have visited recently, faced with this situation, you decide..."
},
	[78090]={ language="In front of the [Saladin] power reactor, you encounter a Shogger emerging from the anchor. After a fierce battle, you successfully kill the Shogger. At this moment, your anti-pollution medicine is running low. Before the Shogger's body dissipates, you decide to..."
},
	[78091]={ language="You successfully completed the investigation of the contaminated area. Although there are still some unclear aspects, overall there are no major issues. To thank you, the Desert survivors offer you their precious resource, [Bronze]. Faced with this gift, you choose to..."
},
	[78092]={ language="You enter the wreckage of the [Saladin] and battle your way through obstacles to reach the central control room of the [Saladin]. However, there are still several enemies here. Hacking and retrieving data will take time. Faced with the enemies and the main console of the Saladin, your choice is..."
},
	[78093]={ language="In front of the [Saladin] power reactor, your team encounters a Shogger emerging from the anchor. After a fierce battle, you successfully kill the Shogger, but afterward, you find a strange mechanical device similar to a Trigger. At this time, your anti-pollution medicine is running low. Your final decision is..."
},
	[78094]={ language="You successfully completed the investigation of the contaminated area. Although there are still some unclear aspects, overall there are no major issues. Ultimately, you choose to be cautious and organize recent data, discovering a strange quantum communication frequency. In this situation, you choose to..."
},
