	[78462]={ language="Your squad and you passed by a survivor camp during exploration, but the remnants seemed displeased with your arrival—whatever the reason, after a battle, you quickly left with the squad."
},
	[78470]={ language="Your instinct tells you that the Void Particles Crystal might be unstable, and you ultimately decided to seal it in despite the risk of contamination, but the pollution from the crystal greatly reduced your Resistance, which means you'll need to inject more Purify Tincture to maintain operations in the future."
},
	[78471]={ language="As a member of Leistance, sealing in Xenocryst is your duty. You risked your life to seal it in, but the pollution also put your body in a dangerous state. After some emergency treatment, you returned to action—"
},
	[78472]={ language="Even the slightest clue is a clue. You spent some time checking these fairly new storage tanks and discovered they were seen in the survivor camp—could these tanks have been brought in by the remnants? What is their purpose here?"
},
	[78473]={ language="Shogger's corpse will disperse soon, and you raced against time, ultimately managing to obtain a biological sample from the Shogger's body and secure it, but the Void Particles' pollution during the operation greatly reduced your Resistance—"
},
	[78474]={ language="In the main camp of the remnants, they offered one of their most precious supplies—the legendary Desert potion [Pure Bronze.] You intended to decline, but the remnants' enthusiasm left you unable to refuse, so you had no choice but to accept it."
},
	[78475]={ language="Breaking into Saladin's data firewall took some time, while also fending off Shogger attacks in the control room, a true danger from all sides. Fortunately, after a bitter battle, you successfully hacked the firewall and obtained the control room data, but the ship's pollution level increased again in the process..."
},
	[78476]={ language="You checked the strange mechanical device but found no clues. However, you seemed to trigger a switch on the device, causing the Void Particles' concentration to rise exponentially, forcing you to leave quickly with the device."
},
	[78477]={ language="[...Use...in debris...first press...]\n[Then...note...]\n[We are...at...junction...]\nOnly broken words remain from the intercepted communication, but you sense a hint of danger."
},
