	[81063]={ language="Fire Operator symbolizes the power of flame, capable of inflicting Burn on enemies. Burn reduces enemy healing effectiveness and removes a percentage of the enemy's Shield Points at the end of the turn."
},
	[81064]={ language="Lightning-type Operator symbolizes the power of lightning, causing enemies to be in Shock state. Enemies in Shock have chances to receive extra damage when hit by Lightning."
},
	[81065]={ language="Ice Operator symbolizes the power of ice, capable of applying Freezing effect to enemies. Freezing lowers enemy speed, significantly reduces Frost resistance at full stacks."
},
	[81066]={ language="Natural Operator symbolizes the power of nature, capable of inflicting Corrosion on enemies. Corrosion reduces enemy Natural Resistance and further reduces enemy percentage defense at full stacks."
},
	[81067]={ language="Quantum Operator symbolizes the power of light and dark, capable of forming Radiation on enemies. Upon Radiation burst, deals Quantum damage scaling with enemy's Max HP%."
},
	[81068]={ language="Physical Operator symbolizes the power of physics, causing enemies to Bleed. Bleed causes Physical damage at the end of each turn."
},
	[81069]={ language="Main Output—Focuses on enhancing own output ability, characterized by high skill intensity and high output maximum."
},
	[81070]={ language="Battle Support—Abilities to boost allies or weaken enemies, crucial for increasing output and enhancing team performance"
},
	[81071]={ language="Secondary Output—Focuses on durability breakthrough, has less output than a Striker, but excels in breaking through durability and boosting Striker's abilities"
},
	[81072]={ language="Healer—A battlefield Healer unit capable of healing ally Operators, effectively improving team longevity and recovery abilities"
},
	[81073]={ language="Powerful Control-Support units with single or group control ability, reduce target's durability by 40% upon successful control"
},
	[81074]={ language="Defender Frontline-Power-type output with damage absorption Feature, capable of absorbing more damage in battle and increases source energy efficiency when absorbing damage"
},
