	[82101]={ language="Uniform assigned after becoming an AIMBS Operator."
},
	[82102]={ language="Flicker's customized Operator outfit, adjusted and made to reflect her personal wishes."
},
	[82103]={ language="[Lingering Leisure] series—Coffee Break.\nCrafted with sleek cuts for a lightweight style, easing unnecessary constraints to help you achieve the perfect balance between work and life.\n[…Ah, hello. Yes, it's break time now... I'm just doing some light reading; it helps me recharge. The weather's a bit chilly, would you like a cup of hot coffee too?]"
},
