	[82113]={ language="Dawn's customized Operator outfit, adjusted and made to reflect her personal wishes."
},
	[82114]={ language="Dawn's expansion Operator outfit—Memories of Vilatria.\nDawn's former attire during her time with the Vilatria Knight Order, representing her earlier days, growth, and pride—all melted away like snow—with these clothes are the only reminder she was once part of the Vilatria Stellar Knights."
},
	[82115]={ language="Uniform assigned after becoming an AIMBS Operator."
},
	[82116]={ language="Lengjiao's customized Operator outfit, adjusted and made to reflect her personal wishes."
},
	[82117]={ language="[Lingering Leisure] series—Wanderer.\nDesigned for traveling Promian people, it adapts traditional Promian attire by discarding bulky fur, using soft special materials with dynamic cuts, combined with traditional patterns to shine with unique fashion vitality."
},
	[82118]={ language="Uniform assigned after becoming an AIMBS Operator."
},
	[82119]={ language="Merlot's customized Operator outfit, adjusted and made to reflect her personal wishes."
},
	[82120]={ language="[Lingering Leisure] series—Unbound Chaos.\nBest choice for a leisurely holiday, shedding constraints, enjoy the short vacation in the most relaxed state. It's often worn by Merlot when roaming the streets.\n[yo~life is a circle, I return to the starting point again... huh? When did you arrive? Listen to this new song I just found, it's really good! No sound? Uh... hahaha, of course there's no sound because I was kidding you, bleh bleh bleh~]"
},
	[82121]={ language="Uniform assigned after becoming an AIMBS Operator."
},
	[82122]={ language="Grenache's customized Operator outfit, adjusted and made to reflect her personal wishes."
},
	[82123]={ language="Uniform assigned after becoming an AIMBS Operator."
},
	[82124]={ language="Echo's customized Operator outfit, adjusted and made to reflect her personal wishes."
},
	[82125]={ language="Uniform assigned after becoming an AIMBS Operator."
},
	[82126]={ language="Karanissa's customized Operator outfit, adjusted and made to reflect her personal wishes."
},
	[82127]={ language="[Lingering Leisure] series—Type-Zero.\nA smart fit racing suit paired with the rare TypeX-00 motorcycle—a swift silhouette racing through the street, leaving a stylish shadow that draws cheers and calls from the Ravend—if you could see her face under the helmet, you'd be amazed by Karanissa's beauty and poise.\n[Racing can free my mind and body, but I advise you not to imitate lightly.]"
},
	[82128]={ language="Uniform assigned after becoming an AIMBS Operator."
},
	[82129]={ language="The standard Campaign outfit exclusively for Alice."
},
	[82130]={ language="Alice's customized Operator outfit, adjusted and made to reflect her personal wishes."
},
	[82131]={ language="Uniform assigned after becoming an AIMBS Operator."
},
	[82132]={ language="Lycosha's customized Operator outfit, adjusted and made to reflect her personal wishes."
},
	[82133]={ language="[Lingering Leisure] series—Tipsy Holiday.\nCustom-made from [Tailored Aristocrat Outfit], each cut crafted by artisans, pure fabric that's high-grade without being showy, elegant with a touch of elegance. For Lycosha, possessing the perfect image fulfills a certain inner desire.\n[For me, the body is both a home and refuge, isn't it just natural to equip our home properly? You say I'm drunk? No way—just slightly tipsy.]"
},
