	[82156]={ language="Uniform assigned after becoming an AIMBS Operator."
},
	[82157]={ language="Uniform assigned after becoming an AIMBS Operator."
},
	[82158]={ language="Lilira's customized Operator outfit, adjusted and made to reflect her personal wishes."
},
	[82159]={ language="[Lingering Leisure] series—Wind's Murmur.\nClassic casual style for outings, made with quality materials, suitable for any activity under bright artificial sunlight.\nHow to wisely use the fleeting holiday hours is quite a challenge for Lilira—but anyway, first put busy work aside and enjoy the restful time tending plants in the small garden.\n[Even though it's just artificial sunshine and blue sky, these plants are absolutely real. Please wait a moment, I'll be right over after watering them.]"
},
	[82160]={ language="Uniform assigned after becoming an AIMBS Operator."
},
	[82161]={ language="Uniform assigned after becoming an AIMBS Operator."
},
	[82162]={ language="Newcastle's customized Operator outfit, adjusted and made to reflect her personal wishes."
},
	[82163]={ language="Uniform assigned after becoming an AIMBS Operator."
},
	[82164]={ language="Core's customized Operator outfit, adjusted and made to reflect her personal wishes."
},
	[82165]={ language="Uniform assigned after becoming an AIMBS Operator."
},
	[82166]={ language="Uniform assigned after becoming an AIMBS Operator."
},
	[82167]={ language="Uniform assigned after becoming an AIMBS Operator."
},
	[82168]={ language="Leather and metal accentuate the waist and long dress, the perfect contrast of colors delivers visual impact, showcasing the unique style and chic of Kroward women."
},
	[82169]={ language="Glimmers of fireflies float above the grassland like a sea of light, surrounding Silvia, creating a captivating image that touches the heart.\n It's the first time Silvia wears such an outfit. The skirt, as light as petals, dances in the air, flowing smoothly and gently, like a beautiful poem engraved deep in the heart, impossible to erase."
},
	[82170]={ language="Yan's usual outfit during her cultivation in the sect, elegant and subtle, with a distinctive style that fully reflects Yan's graceful appearance.\n[The attire neat and pristine, I suddenly set in motion. The winding path leads to tranquility, the bamboo leaves rustling softly. I wish to listen to wisdom from the ancients.]\n[This is—nothing, it's just that wearing this outfit brings back memories of home, that's all.]"
},
	[82171]={ language="Echo dug up the training uniform she wore before her debut and flaunted it in front of you.\n[How nostalgic~ Linker, would you like to hear my story before debut?"
},
	[82172]={ language="Tiya's dress that she often wears to Vilatria's noble banquets, lightweight yet mysterious and elegant, sparkling starlight falls upon the hem, star tracks circle her body, evoking the vast sky.\n[Noble etiquette dictates dresses shouldn't be worn twice... whose rule is that?]"
},
	[82173]={ language="Due to personal past experiences, Lilira didn't attend school as a child, but she often imagined what it would be like to wear a school uniform, walking down campus paths.\n[Wearing the uniform gives me a sense I've never felt before, a feeling of belonging and confidence, youth is wonderful!]"
},
	[82174]={ language="Safety Bureau's holiday costume, ensuring quality and comfort while meeting various AIMBS's wearing needs, striving for detail and accuracy.\n—She's prepared for this leisure moment—exquisite clothes, precious gifts, and rehearsed actions... What to do next?"
},
	[82175]={ language="Private order from Leistance's clothing team in logistics department, meeting individual AIMBS's dressing needs. Note, cannot be ordered through Safety Bureau's intranet. Please contact clothing team leader if needed."
},
	[82176]={ language="Safety Bureau's holiday costume, ensuring quality and comfort while meeting various AIMBS's wearing needs, striving for detail and accuracy.\n—Following advice of others , the girl racked her brains to come up with a gift for the Linker, which is..."
},
	[82177]={ language="Outfit incorporating traditional Eastern Spark Nation elements, tailored to specific body requirements and accessories chosen by customer.\n—[The New Year is coming, are you ready for me to target you again? No matter where, I'll chase and conquer you... Haha!]"
},
	[82178]={ language="Newcastle's gift to Ms. Frost Jade through Linker, kept mysteriously a secret until Frost Jade opens it in front of Linker.\n[You say... this was sent by Ms. Newcastle? Pardon me, this outfit doesn't really match our Spark people's traditional attire habits... Trending here, perhaps?]"
},
	[82179]={ language="This outfit from the distant East has a special significance for Sleipnir's residents, Dawalin swaps to this unique attire and revels in natural beauty before dozing off.\n[Ah... spring is almost here, these flowers are for you, shall we make flower Ravenns together?]"
},
	[82180]={ language="Elsida has often dreamt of her past, lost times unable to be revived, only tangible items available for sentiment... She dons her old attire, celebrates holidays as before, then looks to the future.\n[Who knows what tomorrow is like, I'm not afraid either. Linker, let's bid farewell to the past, we have endless unknown times ahead!]"
},
	[82181]={ language="Private order from Leistance's clothing team in logistics department, meeting individual AIMBS's dressing needs. Note, cannot be ordered through Safety Bureau's intranet. Please contact clothing team leader if needed.\n—[It's raining heavily today, this parasol isn't much help... mind if I use your bathroom and change outfits before handing over work—no peeking, okay?]"
},
	[82182]={ language="Marceline startled tourists on her first arrival at Moonlight Kiss with her scythe and torn attire, so Grenache decided to design her a [uniform] that's elegant, exquisite, yet slightly untouchable.\n[If the Boss likes it, then I like it too; if Linker likes it, I'll be even happier.]"
},
	[82183]={ language="Eucaly always presents her best side every minute, whether it's room decorations or her dress, emphasizing that she is the focus of the moment.\n[Daring enough to stare at me, should I say you're oblivious or too simple... wanting to take this drink, you need courage that fits you... hehe.]"
},
	[82184]={ language="Appears to be an outfit from a recently popular anime. Raven loves it and secretly bought one hiding it in the office, though initially she wanted it to be a secret, not letting anyone know... if not for your sudden entrance.\n[You... dare to spy on the secrets of the night? This must not be divulged! Any conditions! No third person can know!]"
},
	[82185]={ language="Arriving at the meeting place as agreed, only to find it's an abandoned school, surely not lost... while suspecting, Crag appears with a camera saying she's here to ghost hunt, surely not heard wrong?\n[Why am I dressed like this? Because typically in horror stories set in abandoned schools, the lead character is a schoolgirl. I especially took out my old school uniform jacket, though it doesn't fit but wearable, let me take a selfie first as a keepsake heh... ah do you feel the cold wind?]"
},
	[82186]={ language="Sunshine, beach, waves—with everything so fresh to Flicker who grew up inland, especially the sea breeze and waves creating a rejuvenating chill.\n[If possible, I'd like to read novels while soaking up the sun.] [Join me? I can move over, enough space for one more... perhaps.]"
},
	[82187]={ language="Amidst the morning waves, Yan awkwardly adjusts the belt tied around her waist.\n[Decided on a preferred style... specially chosen morning knowing it's just us two without much tension...]\n[You think it looks nice? Th-thanks... you want to see me practice sword in this? Even if practicing in this outfit is just too...]\n[Trying it out... wouldn't hurt... but don't tell anyone, okay?]"
},
	[82188]={ language="Rose picks the perfect spot for sunbathing, sets up the parasol, takes out chilled drinks, and begins her leisure time.\n[What? Staring at my swimsuit in awe? Get your eyes back, there's something left to do. What? Of course, help me apply sunscreen~ I alone can't cover everything!]\n[As for a reward, would you like a cold drink? Or perhaps... should I help apply some on you too? Hehe.]"
},
	[82189]={ language="[Always bringing warmth and acceptance, a girl like an angel arrives, alone with you in the prepared studio at the banquet, dressing you in pure silk, setting your favorite pose, anticipating your artwork.\n]I trust your artistic skills, but... I have a small request.[]No matter how perfect the art piece is, it can't compare to the intricacies real life offers, and my outfit was meticulously chosen for your taste, I don't want this memory only in the painting.]\n[So... once you finish, with your senses and body, appreciate this night's me, could you?]"
},
	[82190]={ language="Sneaking into your room, the young lady without guest mentality directs her staff to set up a corner in the room. Calmly changes into the dress for the upcoming banquet even when caught by the host—\n[Ah, you came back just in time, help me zip up the back... you're the one gaining weight! Feel it, I haven't gained an ounce! Oh, as for the room, it's closer to the hall making it convenient to change... you won't mind, right?]"
},
	[82191]={ language="The girl who promised you a lifetime oath basks in radiant glory, accepting coronation amidst cheers, sitting on her throne, awaiting her king.\n[Enjoy their praises and cheers with me, despite this complex dress wearing it solely to catch your attention, I'd wear it without regret.]"
},
	[82192]={ language="Frost Jade in Eastern attire undoubtedly captures the banquet's attention, godly spirited and joyful yet as you approach with a drink, she's nowhere to be found... scanning around, a slim silhouette slips through the side door.\n[Sorry, for letting you witness such embarrassment, just had a few too many drinks at the banquet, leaving to calm down... wasn't expecting you to notice. Perhaps due to alcohol, this water seemed too cold...]\n[Eh-eh... why did you come down... I'm not trying to reject you, just having you beside feels warmer...]"
},
	[82193]={ language="To prepare for this outing, Veldora planned ahead and cleared her schedule, when meeting you she smiles and holds your hand.\n[At last, Linker, our first outing date right? Such a unique memory deserves commemoration! Should I sing a song and shoot a vlog? Can you join me in the camera?]\n[If fans ask about our relationship? I'll just tell the truth, go public, how about that? Are you willing to face the media together?]"
},
	[82194]={ language="Before being a renowned merchant, Argo was just a young girl.\n[...So liking trendy and fashionable things is no surprise, right? What made Linker think I'd still dress in protective gear in a bustling big city?]\n[Even ignoring this, there's no sense in dressing too serious while accompanying an investor on a shopping trip, want a drink? Let's sit together and admire the night view~]"
},
	[82195]={ language="On the colorful carnival night of Moonlight Kiss, you stroll to the entertainment area and see Olivia beside the billiard table with a cue.\n[Linker? Hehe, just in time, shall we play a round... uh what's this game called again?]\n[Whatever, just hit the balls into the holes right, I'll cheer for you! Want to have some fruit? Ah~]"
},
	[82196]={ language="Without you, Luna wouldn't have come here, the glaring lights and noisy music suffocating her, wanting to shrink into a corner.\nYet as the lead invites her, declining would mar her leading lady persona... Luna drinks the beverage to ease her nerves until—dropping at the bedside.\n[Is it Linker? Uh... there be many of you...]\n[Haha, all those Linkers are my leading men... how will I choose...]"
},
	[82197]={ language="You're the only audience for a stage performance, freely enjoying Lycosha's movements in the dance floor center, as she casually accepts your penetrating gaze, enjoying the moment this proves her success.\n[Linker, the exclusive limited performance next, so forget everything else, focus only on me.]\n[As my audience, you must carefully savor every detail admiringly, hehe~]"
},
	[82198]={ language="Merlot's dream came true as the head bartender and she proudly offers her latest creation.\n[How do you feel after drinking Linker? Dizzy head, warm body?]\n[Want to try this lollipop for relief? Hehe, I meant the one I'm having~]\n[Ah, did we just indirectly kiss? Aha, Linker, you have no shame~]"
},
	[82199]={ language="Even as a busy agent, Karanissa keeps some respite for herself, relaxing on a soft sofa with fine wine, letting time slip by.\nThe exception being the invitation from you, despite long absence, she's not one to refuse you.\n[Although there might've been many misunderstandings between us... but right now, we're just guests enjoying this party together.]\n[You're asking about the outfit? N-not like you asked for it... I'm not... hey, turn back here and look properly!]"
},
