	[83174]={ language="Simple yet fashionable and comfortable tight sportswear, ideal for the school sports meet.\nThe upper body allows freedom of shoulder and back lines, while providing comfort and breathability, keeping Ling fresh during activities; the tight-fitting pants offer excellent flexibility, allowing ease in movement. No matter the activity, this outfit helps challenge the limits and unlock potential.\n[The glory of the champion isn't just the finish line, but the start of my pursuit.]"
},
