	[95025]={ language="Don't want to play this, looks scary..."
},
	[95026]={ language="It's snowing..."
},
	[95027]={ language="Can't forget the tutorial even on holiday..."
},
	[95028]={ language="This year's bonfire could roast a dragon."
},
	[95029]={ language="Heard there's IRL merch hunting nearby..."
},
	[95030]={ language="Did I save...?"
},
	[95031]={ language="Brain-freeze...Just wanna go back and play games..."
},
	[95032]={ language="Hope everyone can be happy every day..."
},
	[95033]={ language="What kind of gifts do kids in the hospital like..."
},
	[95034]={ language="Where did Yuanya and Koraz go..."
},
	[95035]={ language="The milk froze..."
},
	[95036]={ language="Should I keep writing code here..."
},
	[95037]={ language="Where's my portable terminal, Ling..."
},
	[95038]={ language="Finally got rid of those two, what should we play next..."
},
	[95039]={ language="What gifts should I buy for Yan and Raven..."
},
	[95040]={ language="This is also a good place to collect Information."
},
	[95041]={ language="Such a beautiful snowy scene, perfect for a drink."
},
	[95042]={ language="Will the Boss let us return..."
},
	[95043]={ language="If the desires in my heart could come true, it would be the best."
},
	[95044]={ language="Winner-takes-all, I'm sure I'll win."
},
	[95045]={ language="The gun is like a blade wing, beating the enemy in an instant..."
},
	[95046]={ language="Just a consolation prize?! Grr...is this part of the Boss's plan?"
},
	[95047]={ language="Taras, stay up there!Your chill would freeze everyone solid."
},
	[95048]={ language="Such different charm here... not like home at all."
},
	[95049]={ language="Merry Christmas, Linker."
},
	[95050]={ language="Best. Christmas. Ever! Coming here was totally spot-on!"
},
	[95051]={ language="I'm already craving next year's turkey..."
},
	[95052]={ language="Merry Christmas~ Linker!"
