	[95073]={ language="Yan"
},
	[95074]={ language="Raven"
},
	[95075]={ language="Just one more side job, and I can get Seven new paint! Who's Seven? My motorcycle, of course!"
},
	[95076]={ language="Someday I'll ride Seven all the way to Spark!"
},
	[95077]={ language="Want to see the amusement park's activity goals? Here they are... take a look..."
},
	[95078]={ language="Hello... Happy New Year."
},
	[95079]={ language="What souvenirs should I bring for the tribe? Oh, and I need to think carefully about the gift for Linker too.."
},
	[95080]={ language="Let's go find Linker to get a signature later."
},
	[95081]={ language="If we clear this first, our mercenary group's reputation will soar!"
},
	[95082]={ language="I'll record the gameplay, post it on the forums with our mercenary's link, perfect plan!"
},
	[95083]={ language="When it comes to gaming, I won't lose to anyone!"
},
	[95084]={ language="Standing in front of you is the undisputed first place in this game!"
},
	[95085]={ language="Thank you all for loving Spark... hope everyone enjoys your time here."
},
	[95086]={ language="Want me to perform a flying sword trick? No problem!"
},
	[95087]={ language="Today, treat me as just an ordinary high school student here to have fun!"
},
	[95088]={ language="I'll do my homework after today...Ugh, why must heroes suffer like this?"
},
	[95089]={ language="Want to try this? It's delicious... I promise I'm not pranking you this time!"
},
	[95090]={ language="Sister Nana said my mission is to pick up Marceline, so no mischief from me!"
},
	[95091]={ language="Welcome to Dolores Maid Cafe! What would you like to drink?"
},
	[95092]={ language="The mysterious blend of coffee and tea, Dolores Maid Cafe's limited-time special drink. Half-price for the second cup!"
},
	[95093]={ language="I've bought so many curiosities... how will I carry them all back?"
},
	[95094]={ language="I wish we could stay in the city forever instead of returning to the jungle."
},
	[95095]={ language="They call this dramatic performance? Truly inspiring...this Lissugen trip was worth it."
},
	[95096]={ language="What's with their warbling? What does it even mean?"
},
	[95097]={ language="Hmm... Can trees hear wishes like stars do? Is this Spark's magic?"
},
	[95098]={ language="Maybe we could introduce this festival to Vilatria..."
},
	[95099]={ language="Sparklers bond through poetry and convey feelings with lanterns... What wish does your lantern carry?"
},
	[95100]={ language="Seeing these festive sights... feeling homesick is only natural."
},
	[95101]={ language="Let's capture this breathtaking view to share with Linker and our old pals."
},
	[95102]={ language="Are fireworks... flowers of the sky?"
},
	[95103]={ language="If you don't understand the meaning of the fortune, I can provide interpretation services at a favorable price."
},
	[95104]={ language="Just set up a table and fortune sticks and we're practically printing money? Huh, I should definitely take notes on this business model."
},
	[95105]={ language="Past days are like this river's flow, gone beyond recall."
},
	[95106]={ language="My reflection shows no signs of aging these past years..."
},
	[95107]={ language="You're less annoying when you're alone."
},
	[95108]={ language="Recommend some sights worth seeing, and I might keep my distance. Good deal, right?"
},
	[95109]={ language="Hmm, maybe this mechanism could enhance exoskeletons... I need to study its design."
},
	[95110]={ language="[Mechanical Creation]? Looks fascinating..."
