	[111076]={ language="As you delve deeper, this abandoned city becomes more familiar to you, and at the same time, the concentration of Void Particles here continues to rise, making the monsters lingering here increasingly dangerous due to varying degrees of contamination.\nMonster hardness cap +50%, base speed +50, base HP +50%, base attack +50%\nAffected by the Void Particles, the attack buffs provided by casters is capped at 100% of their base attack"
},
	[111077]={ language="As you delve deeper, this abandoned city becomes more familiar to you, and at the same time, the concentration of Void Particles here continues to rise, making the monsters lingering here increasingly dangerous due to varying degrees of contamination.\nMonster hardness cap +75%, base speed +100, base HP +75%, base attack +75%, Block Chance +50%\nMonster attacks have a 25% chance to apply nightmare effect to the target (target attacks reduce by 15% and damage taken increases by 10%), lasting 1 round, up to 2 stacks\nAffected by the Void Particles, the attack buffs provided by casters is capped at 100% of their base attack power"
},
	[111078]={ language="As you delve deeper, this abandoned city becomes more familiar to you, and at the same time, the concentration of Void Particles here continues to rise, making the monsters lingering here increasingly dangerous due to varying degrees of contamination.\nMonster hardness cap +100%, base speed +150, base HP +100%, base attack +100%, Block Chance +50%, Defense Ignore +50%\nMonster attacks have a 40% chance to apply nightmare effect to the target (target attacks reduce by 15% and damage taken Increased 10%), lasting 1 round, up to 2 stacks\nMonster attacks have a 25% chance to apply binding effect to the target (target will be unable to release Energy Burst and receives reduced healing and shield effects by 40%), lasting 1 round\nAffected by the Void Particles, the attack buffst provided by casters is capped at 100% of their base attack power"
},
	[111079]={ language="As you delve deeper, this abandoned city becomes more familiar to you, and at the same time, the concentration of Void Particles here continues to rise, making the monsters lingering here increasingly dangerous due to varying degrees of contamination.\nMonster hardness cap +150%, base speed +200, base HP +200%, base attack +150%, Block Chance +50%, ignore defense +50%, Defense Ignore +40%\nMonster attacks have a 50% chance to apply nightmare effect to the target (target attacks reduce by 15%, defense reduces by 20%, and damage taken increases by 10%), lasting 1 round, up to 2 stacks\nMonster attacks have a 35% chance to apply binding effect to the target (target will be unable to release Energy Burst and receives reduced healing and shield effects by 40%), lasting 1 round\nAffected by the Void Particles, the attack buffs provided by casters is capped at 100% of their base attack power"
},
