	[111149]={ language="Dangerous Occupation"
},
	[111150]={ language="The nationals of the old era who linger in the streets, now indistinguishable from the Mutants they fought against, will seek out any foreigner who enters this city."
},
	[111151]={ language="Even in today's times, they could be called Elite. Even if they are no longer human, they will loyally guard their country, driving away all outsiders."
},
	[111152]={ language="You cannot bypass them; these creatures called monsters firmly occupy this area, indifferent to friend or foe, with no one escaping their attacks."
},
