},
	[111171]={ language="The outermost region of Puruis City, where the great Infeno grants outsiders the chance to meet and allows them a brief stay. With the kingdom's destruction, the passersby here were polluted by the escaping Void Particles, trapped in endless wandering."
},
	[111172]={ language="Some chosen by Him, filled with fervent faith in the Creator, voluntarily came here. They praise His greatness, build temples for Him, and preach His mercy to everyone. Today, they, along with the old kingdom, have been abandoned by Him."
},
	[111173]={ language="Some claim to have received His revelation and marked the city center according to His prophecy. They obsessively carved His totem here in their own way, madly worshiping Him. Even moments before the city's destruction, they prayed to Him, praised His gifts, believing this was a sign of ascending the civilization ladder."
},
	[111174]={ language="Light of Civilization"
},
	[111175]={ language="Points gained from successful exploration will convert to a certain ratio into the Light of Civilization (different difficulty level have different conversion caps)"
},
