	[112001]={ language="Recycle It"
},
	[112002]={ language="[Gained relic: Antique Transmitter]"
},
	[112003]={ language="Regrettably, its frequency does not overlap with the unknown signal received, instead attracting some Mutants living in the sea. As an artifact, it's better to take it back—of course, this means you must be more cautious afterwards."
},
	[112004]={ language="Ignore It"
},
	[112005]={ language="Nothing Happened"
},
	[112006]={ language="You quickly reminded yourself not to waste time on irrelevant things while submerging and leaving this potential current area."
},
	[112007]={ language="Check It Out"
},
	[112008]={ language="[Gained relic: Stellar Crystal Sphere]"
},
	[112009]={ language="Don't miss any anomalies in exploration—just a little more attention can yield some extras. For instance, now, as you approach, Void Particles are filtered and dispelled, revealing a familiar—looking gem inside."
},
	[112010]={ language="Leave directly"
},
	[112011]={ language="Stay cautious and keep your distance"
},
	[112012]={ language="That kind of whirlpool looks really dangerous, better stay away from it."
},
	[112013]={ language="Leave promptly"
},
	[112014]={ language="[Gained relic: Dashboard]"
},
	[112015]={ language="The opponent's strength is unknown, so you don't want to confront it directly. You quickly hide in an abandoned building nearby. Then, something on the ground trips you. Looking closely, it seems like a control device—of course, already broken for a long time. Even though you don't know what it's used for, you decide to keep it for now."
},
	[112016]={ language="Face it head-on"
},
	[112017]={ language="A close call"
},
	[112018]={ language="You should never back down when facing any crisis, you thought to yourself, and stepped forward. However, the other person walked right past you."
},
	[112019]={ language="Pause for a moment"
},
	[112020]={ language="[Gained Relic: SD Data Chip]"
},
	[112021]={ language="You found an antique in the abandoned cabin: an old chip that uses SD Technology for storage. Nowadays, it's been discarded, and many people don't even recognize it; only a few institutions still keep devices that can read it. /n Luckily, it was well-protected and hardly water-damaged."
},
	[112022]={ language="Leave early"
},
	[112023]={ language="One minute of silence"
},
	[112024]={ language="You don't know if there are other dangers here. After saluting the fearless hero, you left."
},
	[112025]={ language="Investigate carefully"
},
	[112026]={ language="[Gained Relic: Monument Fragment]"
},
	[112027]={ language="As you get closer, the light source finally becomes clear, it seems to be the inscription of some monument.\n[We pray, so we receive. Do not leave the city to monsters, nor give the future to foreigners...] \nYou struggle to make out the characters above, but unfortunately, they are incomplete, and you can't accurately interpret its meaning.\nOh no, Mutant is about to wake up, hurry up and leave!"
},
	[112028]={ language="Leave promptly"
},
	[112029]={ language="You can't guarantee checking it without waking Mutant."
},
	[112030]={ language="You left here quickly"
},
	[112031]={ language="Endure discomfort"
},
	[112032]={ language="[Gained relic: Strange Illusion Record]"
},
	[112033]={ language="Many people passed in front of your eyes, coming closer and then quickly moving away. You felt a sense of déjà vu.\nMeanwhile, the rhythm of the sound waves calmed down, and you suddenly realized that those familiar figures were the people you knew at the security bureau. Just as you were astonished, you faintly heard someone calling for help, exactly like the cries for help you heard in your dream.\nCould there really be surviving Infeno people here? You tried to find the source of the cries but had no luck.\nSuch an important matter should be reported to the higher-ups."
},
	[112034]={ language="Use medication"
},
	[112035]={ language="The world became quiet, and the strange hallucinations vanished."
},
	[112036]={ language="After confirming there are no other abnormalities with your body, you decide to continue your exploration."
},
	[112037]={ language="Smash it"
},
	[112038]={ language="[Gained relic: Odd Xenocryst]"
},
	[112039]={ language="Damn broken machine, it's all its fault!\nThe machine turned into a pile of scrap metal under your heavy blow, but the electromagnetic waves didn't disappear. You searched through it again and found a strange Xenocryst. Holding it in your hand, it faintly trembled—this made you realize that the strange sound waves might be connected to it.\nAfter carefully placing it into a special container, you left the place, deep in thought."
},
	[112040]={ language="Try to shut down"
},
	[112041]={ language="A genius mechanic should ensure the equipment is in perfect condition."
},
	[112042]={ language="To avoid attracting the monster's attention, you quickly cut off the machine's power, and both the machine noises and the strange sound waves disappeared."
},
	[112043]={ language="Looking for clues"
},
	[112044]={ language="[Gained relic: The Torn Photograph]"
},
	[112045]={ language="Brave as you are, you fully embraced the spirit of exploration, searching for clues without wasting a second. In a corner of the room, you found an old yellowed photo, a group picture where the top half had been torn off. The only visible part showed a white-haired little girl standing in the center, surrounded by others. As soon as you saw her, you had a fleeting sense of familiarity—where had you seen her before?\nThere was no time to dwell on it, as it seemed the beast had noticed you. You hurriedly left the place."
},
