},
	[112409]={ language="At the start of battle, there is an 80% chance to inflict Frozen effect on all enemies for 1 turn"
},
	[112410]={ language="Operators have a 30% chance to give all allies 1 stack of attack buff after activating Energy Burst (Attack increases by 5%), lasting 2 turns, up to 3 stacks (stackable)"
