},
	[112414]={ language="When [Artificial Weather] control is successfully applied, all allies gain 1 stack of Damage Immunity (damage reduces by 15%) when successfully applied, up to 3 stacks."
},
	[112415]={ language="Enemy's effect resistance reduces by 1% each time they are attacked, lasting 2 turns, up to 6 stacks(different level stackable)."
},
	[112416]={ language="Enemy's effect resistance reduces by 1.5% each time they are attacked, lasting 2 turns, up to 6 stacks(different level stackable)."
