	[10000380]={ language="Snow Mountain Surprise Night"
},
	[10000381]={ language="On the eighty-first hour after the anchor event, an airship from Kroward lands at Lissugen's second airport.\nKroward, a country proud of the glory of old technology, their unchanged life spanning generations, like a dazzling crystal chandelier, magnificent yet fragile.\nAre they here to save or to destroy?"
},
	[10000382]={ language="In the depths of Selevie's wilderness stands the deep, ancient native tribe [Sleipnir], where time's traces flow and Silvia's protection roams.\nWhen calamity strikes, the natives' vision to defend their homeland naturally conflicts with the authorities' idea to relocate the population.\nThe storm stains the sky, Silvia's power reveals itself, and the sanctuary is on the brink of breaking.\nWho can possibly stop it all?"
},
	[10000383]={ language="An invitation from an ancient country, Vilatria, a mysterious nation under the stars, reappears before the world.\nYou are tasked by Leistance to serve as a diplomat, visiting Vilatria with Centaurea.\nA seemingly peaceful country where class divisions, extreme religious zeal, and the undercurrents behind sacred ceremonies show this invitation is not as simple as it seems.\nThe vanished knight commander, the mysterious Starcall Abbey, the untold truth of the knight selection.\nBehind it all lies a century-span shocking lie.\nUnder the gaze from beyond the stars, who can remain untouched?"
},
	[10000384]={ language="You are brought to the underground of Vilatria as a sinner, welcomed by a vast abandoned prison.\nYet, the source of sin lies not in law but in human strife and deals of interest.\nTrapped with no way out, you receive a new task from above, to venture into the deepest part of the prison, seeking the only other prisoner there.\nIs your encounter with her a destiny, or is it the orchestration of a stronger force?\nThrough the lost dream, connected with her soul, you return to Vilatria a hundred years ago to experience the sealed historical past…"
},
	[10000385]={ language="Lissugen, after disasters, is blossoming anew, as the winter snow festival quietly arrives. As streets are decorated lavishly, a small [crisis] gradually emerges… What miracles will happen beneath this stunning snowy scene?"
},
	[10000386]={ language="The year comes to an end, winter gives way to spring.\nOld friends and new alike gather for a joyful time.\nA distant land called [Spark] reveals its mysterious veil in a city beyond the sea.\n[A grand garden party led by local business partnerships and Dreams Consult is soon to open, inviting mysterious guests from Starlight, letting you experience the authentic Spark festivities.]"
},
	[10000387]={ language="Unreliable reports say unknown biological activities have appeared recently in northeast Burksomi, behavior and appearance distinct from ordinary Mutant, and without aggression.\nSome paranormal enthusiasts suggest these creatures share traits with rumored ghosts.\n[Yeah, Karen, that's what everyone says. Many have gone and returned in quite a fright.]\n[Haha, of course, I want to go, even if not for ghost hunting, a trip to the mountain is good fun!]\n[As for my secret weapon? I'll keep it secret for now. You'll see when we get there!]"
},
	[10000388]={ language="Opens on {1} {2}, {0}"
},
	[10000389]={ language="Into the Wilderness"
},
	[10000390]={ language="A quake in the deep Selevie jungle causes varying degrees of disaster in nearby tribes, provoking major conglomerates to lend aid; amidst this, a specially marked, deemed top secret letter lands on Linker's desk…"
},
	[10000391]={ language="Puppet and Sincerity"
},
	[10000392]={ language="In a former mansion on Lissugen's outskirts, you meet a young lady from abroad… As she puts it, [a Wisp fated to fade away.] At the end lies fire and ashes, and amidst the surging undercurrents, you grasp her hand."
},
	[10000393]={ language="Garden Afterword"
},
	[10000394]={ language="It must be admitted, everyone succumbs to Linker's charm—even Newcastle invites you to attend and host the opening of the latest garden party.\nOriginally thought to be a routine invitation, you were poised to attend upon branch chief agreement. Yet amid their prolonged and hidden conversations, you detected an unusual scent…\n[Well then, Linker, it's time for you to rate both me and my senior sister. This outcome will determine the wager between the Boss and the Branch Director, please weigh your judgment carefully.]"
},
	[10000395]={ language="[Apostle-class] Shogger—After Scorpio Incident, the sealed [Prophecy] becomes a possible future reality, alerting everyone to the crisis of planet and human survival again. To seize the sole chance for human civilization's continuity, Linker and Alicia head to the desert city standing in the wilderness, seeking out the long-lost [Xenocryst] fragments…"
},
	[10000396]={ language="Delving into Foden City, you face joint pursuit from Foden City and the Coordinators. Amidst heavy obstruction, you separate from Alicia. To reunite, you must find this [deadlock's] breakthrough point…"
},
	[10000397]={ language="Caught in Foden City's Anchor Space, you unveil the truth of Eden; a sorrowful girl under mysterious voice guidance recalls past promises… Under the elegy of a pure white realm, wield the power awakened by love to return to those you cherish."
},
	[10000398]={ language="At the Pope's invitation, you, along with Centaurea and Dawn, return to [the country blessed by stars] Vilatria, and board the largest observatory train—the Circumstellar Train—meeting a girl named [Zeppelin.] Yet no one could predict how your encounter may utterly transform Vilatria…"
},
