},
	[10000556]={ language="Following the conclusion of the Circumstellar Train incident, the second Knight Selection Tournament promptly recommenced. After witnessing the anomalous phenomena deep within Vilatria, the former knight Dawn chose to set foot upon the competitive grounds once more. On her path to ascend to the highest rank, you and she will confront the 'darkness' that pervades this star-blessed land—a darkness rooted in a singular 'lie'."
},
	[10000557]={ language="As shadows envelop Stardom, the enigmatic Void Hunter emerges before you once again. With her arrival comes the unraveling of Vilatria's truth... Life and death, wrong and right—you must now make a choice."
},
